RADAR_LOAD("2025-10",[{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5686262","t":"Flash Joule heating synthesis of octahedral-like porous ZrC nanoparticles and its photothermal performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5686262","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-10-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["xin yan","Xinru Ren","Na Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪热法合成八面体状多孔 ZrC 纳米颗粒及其光热性能","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202509221","t":"Rapid Heating Technologies for Efficient Recycling of Spent Lithium‐Ion Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202509221","s":"Small","d":"2025-10-31","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The rapid growth of electric vehicles and portable electronics has led to a surge in lithium‐ion battery (LIB) consumption, creating an urgent need for efficient and sustainable recycling solutions. Among the established recycling methods, including pyrometallurgical, hydrometallurgical, and direct recycling, thermal treatment plays a critical role. However, conventional heating techniques are often energy‐intensive and time‐consuming due to their low heating rates. This highlights the importance of exploring advanced rapid heating technologies for recycling spent LIBs. This review examines the role of heating in various LIB recycling processes and systematically introduces emerging rapid heating technologies, such as microwave heating, joule heating, and short contact time heating. In addition, advanced approaches, including induction heating, plasma heating, and CSR heating pr","au":["Xuhui Zhu","Yuan Wang","Kathryn Mumford","Zongping Shao","Hamidreza Arandiyan","Shun Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"快速加热技术用于废旧锂离子电池高效回收","zb":"研究考察了加热在锂离子电池（LIB）回收过程中的作用，系统介绍了微波加热、焦耳加热和短接触时间加热等新兴快速加热技术。还讨论了感应加热、等离子体加热和 CSR 加热过程的原理、流程、独特效应及其在 LIB 回收中的应用。最后概述了当前挑战和未来展望，以支持快速加热技术在废旧 LIB 回收中的高效和规模化应用，并提出了快速加热过程用于废旧 LIB 高效回收。"},{"id":"10.11628/ksppe.2025.28.5.615","t":"A Study on Hydration Reactions Involved in the Reduction of Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) by Hydroponic Vegetated Biofilters","u":"https://doi.org/10.11628/ksppe.2025.28.5.615","s":"Journal of People, Plants, and Environment","d":"2025-10-31","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Background and objective: Nitrogen dioxide (NO2), a prominent component of nitrogen oxides (NOx), is recognized as a major air pollutant. This gaseous pollutant significantly contributes to the secondary formation of ultrafine particulate matter (PM2.5) through atmospheric chemical reactions. While nature-based solutions (NbS), such as the use of plants, have been explored as environmentally friendly mitigation strategies, the effectiveness of relying solely on the plant physiological processes remains limited in effectively removing these pollutants. This study aimed to conduct foundational research on the pollutant reduction efficacy of a hydroponic vegetated biofilter, which leverages both plant physiological action and the induced hydration reaction of NO2.Methods: This study investigated the potential for NO2 removal through hydration reactions and its subsequent conversion to nitra","au":["Jae Young Lee","Ye Jin Kim","Tae Han Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Reduction of Nitrogen"],"zt":"水培植被生物过滤器中涉及氮氧化物还原的水合反应研究","zb":"该研究通过室内空气质量室测量了水培植被生物过滤器在灌溉和非灌溉条件下的 NO2 浓度变化，发现灌溉条件下 NO2 去除效率平均为 52.54%，显著高于非灌溉条件下的 23.92%。"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.5c03036","t":"Atomically Dispersed Mo for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction: Nitrogen-Doped Defective Graphene Support","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.5c03036","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2025-10-31","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Efficient electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) under mild conditions is highly desired for achieving cost-effective application but is challenging to realize in practice. Previous studies have shown that atomically dispersed Mo on a graphene-like two-dimensional (2D) support can be a promising catalyst for NRR. Here, we show the outstanding electrocatalytic performance of a Mo-based atomically dispersed metal catalyst (ADMC) on a N-doped defective graphene support (Mox-N6-gra (x = 1-3)) by using density functional theory computations. Particular attention is paid to the underlying reaction mechanism for NRR. The computed formation energy and ab initio molecular dynamics simulation suggest that the N atoms doped on the graphene support can firmly anchor the Mo atoms in both Mo1-N6-gra and Mo2-N6-gra configurations, which are highly beneficial for NRR. In particular, Mo1-N6-gr","au":["Wei Zhang","Yunxiang Di","Xiongyi Liang","Xiao Cheng Zeng"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 fixation"],"zt":"用于高效电催化氮还原的单原子 Mo：氮掺杂缺陷石墨烯载体","zb":"研究对象为单原子 Mo 在氮掺杂缺陷石墨烯载体上的电催化氮还原反应 (NRR)。采用密度泛函理论计算研究其性能和反应机理。计算表明，氮原子可以牢固锚定 Mo 原子，有利于 NRR。Mo1-N6-gra 通过远程机理表现出高催化活性，极限电位为 -0.23 V，优于许多其他载体上的单原子催化剂。Mo1-N6-gra 还能有效抑制竞争的析氢反应 (HER)。Mo2-N6-gra 也是一种高性能单原子催化剂，极限电位为 -0.35 V，采用不同的催化机理。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s43153-025-00614-8","t":"Manipulating the intricate relationship between synthesis parameters in the induction heating method for the preparation of thick and crystalline zeolite coatings","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s43153-025-00614-8","s":"Brazilian Journal of Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Taylan Maraş","Melkon Tatlier","Ayşe Erdem"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"感应加热法制备厚且结晶的沸石涂层中合成参数的复杂关系调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5cy00912j","t":"d-Band center modulation in CuNi alloy/graphene oxide catalysts for enhanced electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis from nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cy00912j","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2025-10-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This optimization resulted in exceptional performance, achieving an ammonia yield of 3.47 mg h −1 cm −2 and a Faraday efficiency (FE) of 85.2% at an overpotential of −0.5 V vs. RHE.","au":["Zhen Yuan","Zhuangzhuang Liang","Renhong Chen","Hongjia Zhai","Liguo Gao","Xuefeng Ren"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"CuNi 合金/氧化石墨烯催化剂中 d-带中心调制以增强电催化硝酸盐合成氨的性能","zb":"研究对象为 CuNi 合金/氧化石墨烯催化剂在电催化硝酸盐合成氨方面的性能。优化后的催化剂在 -0.5 V vs RHE 的过电位下实现了 3.47 mg h −1 cm −2 的氨产率和 85.2% 的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.5c07379","t":"Efficient Ambient Electrosynthesis of Ammonia over a Vanadium-Doped MnO 2 Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.5c07379","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2025-10-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia serves as an ideal hydrogen energy carrier due to its safe transportability and potential as a renewable, zero-carbon fuel. The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) in aqueous electrolytes under ambient conditions, powered by renewable energy sources, represents a sustainable pathway. To maximize process efficiency, catalyst design must prioritize selective N2 adsorption while effectively suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Building upon theoretical and experimental evidence that transition metals with unoccupied d-orbitals facilitate N2 adsorption and inert bond activation, we developed vanadium-doped manganese oxide electrocatalysts for ambient-condition ammonia synthesis. The optimized V-MnO2(0.2) catalyst exhibits exceptional performance, delivering an NH3 yield rate of 14.5 μg h– 1 mgcat – 1 and a Faradaic efficiency of 17.3% at −0.4 V ","au":["Lanxiang Huang","Xi Jiang","Renchuan Deng","Qin Wang","Ting Long","Yuan Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在环境条件下高效氨的电合成：钒掺杂 MnO2 催化剂","zb":"研究对象为钒掺杂 MnO2 催化剂在环境条件下的电化学氨合成。通过理论计算和实验验证，优化后的 V-MnO2(0.2) 催化剂在 -0.4 V vs RHE 下氨产率率为 14.5 μg h– 1 mgcat – 1，法拉第效率为 17.3%（-0.3 V 下为 28%）。该研究提供了通过过渡金属掺杂调节电子结构、设计选择性 N2 吸附活性位点以及开发无贵金属 NRR 催化剂的设计原理。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/w17213106","t":"Electrochemical Ammonia Oxidation in Water Treatment: A Comprehensive Review on Mechanisms, Catalysts, and Implementation Challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/w17213106","s":"Water","d":"2025-10-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The discharge of ammonia-rich wastewater poses significant threats to water quality and ecosystem health, driving the need for efficient and sustainable treatment technologies. The electrochemical ammonia oxidation reaction (eAOR) has emerged as a promising alternative to conventional biological and physicochemical methods, offering advantages such as in situ oxidant generation, tunable product selectivity, and applicability under challenging water matrices. This comprehensive review systematically examines the mechanisms, catalyst design, and environmental factors influencing eAOR performance. Two primary pathways are detailed: direct eAOR, involving stepwise dehydrogenation of NH3 on the electrode surface, and indirect eAOR, mediated by electrogenerated reactive chlorine species (RCS). The mechanisms—including the Oswin-Salomon and Gerischer-Mauerer pathways for direct oxidation, as we","au":["Xuanxu Shen","Fang Ma"],"o":"回填","zt":"水处理中的电化学氨氧化：关于机理、催化剂和实施挑战的综述","zb":"综述了电化学氨氧化反应 (eAOR) 的机理、催化剂设计和环境因素。详细讨论了直接 eAOR（氨在电极表面的逐步脱氢）和间接 eAOR（由电生成的活性氯物种介导）两种主要途径。分析了不同机理（Oswin-Salomon 和 Gerischer-Mauerer 路径，以及 breakpoint chlorination 和自由基介导路线）的实验和理论证据。强调了提高活性、对 N2 的选择性和耐久性的电催化剂开发进展。分析了 pH、氯浓度和共存离子等关键操作参数对反应动力学和副产物形成的影响。最后，确定了当前挑战（催化剂中毒、有毒副产物生成和可扩展性），并概述了未来研究方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c08337","t":"Precise Vacancy Fitting of Horizontal Dinitrogen for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c08337","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Efficient ammonia synthesis under mild conditions remains a significant challenge in modern chemistry. Chemical looping ammonia synthesis (CLAS) presents a sustainable alternative for ammonia production under near-ambient pressure conditions. In this study, we introduce a \"horizontal N2\" approach in the CLAS process, where an N2 molecule is horizontally incorporated into the surface lattice of the catalyst, facilitating effective N2 activation and subsequent NH3 production. Utilizing barium carbide (BaC2) as a model material, we show that the surface dianion vacancy sites of BaC2 provide optimal spacing for N2 activation, while the loaded Ni nanoparticles are responsible for H2 activation, enabling N2 hydrogenation from both ends to produce NH3 under mild conditions. Resonant inelastic X-ray scattering (RIXS) analysis combined with computational calculations reveals that the rate-determi","au":["Bo Dai","Zichuang Li","Wenqian Li","Jiang Li","Xiaojun Lu","Kailong Qian"],"o":"回填","w":["Hideo Hosono","Tian-Nan Ye"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"水平二氮分子精确空位拟合用于氨合成","zb":"研究在化学循环氨合成（CLAS）中引入“水平N2”策略，利用BaC2表面二阴离子空位位点激活N2，结合Ni纳米颗粒活化H2。RIXS分析表明反应决速步为*HNNH的氢化，Ni/BaC2在100 °C和常压下产率比传统CLAS催化剂高一个数量级，且在20小时内保持稳定。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c06018","t":"From Pinhole Density to Nucleation Onset: A Numerical Model for SAM Barrier Performance in Selective Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c06018","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) are widely used as blocking layers in area-selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD), yet the kinetics of their failure by pinhole nucleation remain poorly quantified. In this work, we develop a numerical model that represents pinhole filling with a sigmoid function, enabling high-accuracy fits to nucleation data across multiple material systems. The model shows that lower pinhole density D ─produced by smoother substrates and stronger SAM–substrate binding─extends the nucleation delay, in agreement with experiments. Increased surface roughness or weaker chemical binding reduces the compactness and ordering of SAMs, increasing D and accelerating the onset of nucleation. The characteristic delay cycle, Cd, scales with the time needed to fill pinholes: longer SAM chains and bulky, less-reactive precursors lengthen Cd, whereas smaller, highly reactive precu","au":["Wenda Liu","Yanwei Wen","Rong Chen","Bin Shan"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"从针孔密度到成核起始：SAM 阻挡层性能在选择性原子层沉积中的数值模型","zb":"建立了一个数值模型来描述选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）中自组装单分子膜（SAMs）因针孔成核而失效的动力学。模型显示，较低的针孔密度能延长成核延迟，这与实验一致。表面粗糙度增加或化学结合减弱会加速成核。模型将可测量的表面性质与成核行为联系起来，为设计高选择性的SAMs提供了指导。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c11084","t":"Artificial Frustrated Lewis Pairs for Ampere-Level Ammonia Synthesis and High-Power-Density Zinc-Nitrate Battery","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11084","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Cu-based electrocatalysts exhibit superior reduction kinetics in the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) and suppress competing hydrogen evolution reaction, making NO3RR an alternative to the traditional Haber-Bosch process in NH3 production. However, the NO3RR in NH3 production involves a nine-proton and eight-electron process, and its performance is constrained by the poor capacity to generate protons. In this study, frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) were introduced into Cu-based catalysts to create La-doped Cu2O, in which the FLPs [Cu-O-La-Ov] (where v denotes vacancy) formed by the Lewis acidic sites Ov and Lewis basic sites O in the Cu-O-La motif served as active sites. These active sites facilitated H2O dissociation, providing ample protons for the NO3RR hydrogenation. The La9-CuOx catalyst exhibited an ultralow NH3 production overpotential of only 290 mV, achieving an N","au":["Shaoce Zhang","Dong Chen","Rong Zhang","Xinru Yang","Xintao Ma","Chuan Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于安培级氨合成和高功率密度锌硝酸盐电池的人工 frustrated Lewis 对","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸根还原反应（NO3RR），关键方法为将 frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) 引入 La 掺杂的 Cu2O 催化剂中，以促进 H2O 分解提供质子。La9-CuOx 催化剂在 -0.4 V vs RHE 时氨产率密度为 1.76 A cm–2，氨产率 139.5 mg h–1 cm–2，法拉第效率 98.9%。基于 La9-CuOx 的 Zn-NO3- 电池功率密度达 80.6 mW cm–2，氨产率 21.4 mg h–1 cm–2。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202504493","t":"Efficient and Stable Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis Promoted by in Situ Alloying in Tubular Protonic Ceramic Electrolysis Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202504493","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Protonic Ceramic Electrolysis Cells (PCECs) enable the in situ production of hydrogen and protons via steam electrolysis, positioning them as promising reactors for environmentally friendly ammonia synthesis. However, the efficiency and stability of this process are currently constrained by the limited catalysis activity and the aggregation of conventional fuel electrodes. Herein, in situ formed Fe‐Co‐Ni alloy nanoparticle catalysts are designed, and find that these alloy sites significantly enhance N 2 adsorption. Selective impregnation of Fe‐Co and Ni exsolution is integrate to promote the in situ formation of Fe‐Co‐Ni alloy catalytic sites within the fuel electrode of tubular PCECs (10 cm 2 active area). Under an applied voltage of 0.6 V, the in situ alloyed PCEC reactor reaches 2.37 × 10 −8 mol s −1 NH 3 synthesis rate at 600 °C, which is 2.1 times that of with common fuel e","au":["Xingzhi Zhu","Xiaoyun Miao","Chu Chen","Xiaofeng Ye","Yucun Zhou","Zhaoyin Wen"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过管状质子陶瓷电解池中的原位合金化促进高效稳定的电化学氨合成","zb":"研究对象为管状质子陶瓷电解池 (PCECs) 中的原位合金化对电化学氨合成的促进作用。设计并制备了原位形成的 Fe‐Co‐Ni 合金纳米粒子催化剂，这些合金位点显著增强了 N 2 吸附。在 0.6 V 电压和 600 °C 下，原位合金化 PCEC 反应器达到 2.37 × 10 −8 mol s −1 的氨合成速率，是普通燃料电极的 2.1 倍。密度泛函理论计算表明，合金化降低了氮氢化反应的活化能。此外，原位形成的合金位点表现出强锚定效应，有效防止了高温下的催化剂聚集，实现了 250 小时内的稳定高效氨合成。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/catal15111016","t":"Facile Synthesis of Uniform NiO Nanoparticles Exclusively Confined in Mesoporous SBA-15 with High Loading for Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal15111016","s":"Catalysts","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The fabrication of highly loaded and uniformly dispersed metal oxide nanoparticles (NPs) is much desired but still remains a great challenge. Herein, the NiO NPs exclusively confined in mesoporous silica SBA-15 were obtained by using nickel nitrate hydrate as a precursor through a facile solvent-free preparation method, which comprised manual grinding of Ni(NO3)2·6H2O with SBA-15 and subsequent air calcination. Characterization results from X-ray diffraction (XRD) and transmission electron microscope (TEM) revealed that aggregation-free NiO nanoparticles with sizes of 3–5 nm were obtained at loading as high as 20 wt.% (weight%). Further increasing the NiO loading to 30 wt.% led to partial agglomeration of discrete nanoparticles to rod-like particles, while no external particles were observed. By comparing the sample derived from nickel acetate with exclusively external NiO particles, it ","au":["Yun Xu","Tianfa Tang","Pengyao Wang","Chunlei Zhang","Jianbo Zhao","Ke Zhuang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"易于合成的均一 NiO 纳米颗粒完全限制在介孔 SBA-15 中用于氨分解","zb":"研究对象为 NiO 纳米颗粒在介孔 SBA-15 中的负载，关键方法为使用 Ni(NO3)2·6H2O 和 SBA-15 通过无溶剂方法制备，包括手动研磨和后续空气煅烧。XRD 和 TEM 表征显示获得无团聚的 NiO 纳米颗粒（尺寸 3–5 nm），负载量高达 20 wt.%。NiO 纳米颗粒在氨分解反应中表现出高稳定性，在 650 °C 下 60 h NH3 转化率为 93.7% at WHSV 30,000 mL·g−1·h−1。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.5c02721","t":"Suppressing Anion Repulsion for Enhancing Li-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c02721","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction (Li-NRR) presents a sustainable alternative to Haber–Bosch for ammonia synthesis. Efficiency and stability are critically governed by the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI), which regulates reactant transport and suppresses side reactions. While anion-derived SEI formed under anion-rich solvation is beneficial, conventional electric double layer (EDL) repel anion at the cathode, limiting favorable SEI formation. Therefore, this study introduces cationic ionomer additives that form a positively charged ionic interfacial layer, mitigating anion repulsion and reducing interfacial solvent accumulation. An imidazolium (C 3 H 4 N 2 )-functionalized cation ionomer enables the formation of a tailored EDL, achieving a Faradaic efficiency and ammonia yield of 92 ± 3% and 58 ± 4 nmol s –1 cm –2, markedly surpassing the conventional EDL (63 ± 7%, 2","au":["Chaeeun Lim","Yurim Sohn","Minjun Kwon","Dong-Hwa Seo","Wooyul Kim","Kijung Yong"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"抑制阴离子排斥以增强锂介导的氮还原","zb":"本研究引入阳离子离子聚合物添加剂形成带正电的离子界面层，缓解了阴离子排斥并减少了界面溶剂积累，实现了 92 ± 3% 的法拉第效率和 58 ± 4 nmol s–1 cm–2 的氨产率。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.5c02502","t":"Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Using Co 3 O 4 Nanowires Supported on TiO 2 /Ti","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.5c02502","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2025-10-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a sustainable alternative for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions, addressing both nitrate pollution and the energy-intensive nature of the Haber–Bosch process. In this work, Co 3 O 4 nanowires supported on TiO 2 /Ti were synthesized and evaluated for NO 3 RR in an H-type electrochemical cell using Ar-saturated 1.0 mol L –1 NaOH containing 20 mmol L –1 NaNO 3 . After confirming NO 3 RR activity via cyclic voltammetry, 1 h chronoamperometry was performed at potentials ranging from 0 to −0.4 V vs RHE (in 100 mV steps). The catalyst exhibited ammonia production at 0.0 V vs RHE, achieving a maximum faradaic efficiency (FE) of 80.0 ± 5.8% at −0.3 V vs RHE and a maximum yield rate (YR) of 93.3 ± 5.7 μmol h –1 cm –2 at −0.4 V vs RHE. This combination of high FE and low onset po","au":["Kauan L. Gomes","Manuel E. G. Winkler","Matheus P. Sales","João Batista Souza Junior","Juliano Alves Bonacin","Raphael Nagao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"使用负载在 TiO2/Ti 上的 Co3O4 纳米线进行硝酸根到氨的电催化还原","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸根还原反应（NO3RR），关键方法为制备负载在 TiO2/Ti 上的 Co3O4 纳米线催化剂，并在 Ar 饱和 1.0 mol L–1 NaOH 溶液（含 20 mmol L–1 NaNO3）中进行电化学测试。催化剂在 0.0 V vs RHE 时产生氨，最大法拉第效率（FE）为 80.0 ± 5.8% at –0.3 V vs RHE，最大产率速率（YR）为 93.3 ± 5.7 μmol h–1 cm–2 at –0.4 V vs RHE，并在 12 次连续 1 h 恒电流测试中保持稳定。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.5c02713","t":"Liquid Sorption-Enhanced Haber–Bosch Process","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.5c02713","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2025-10-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The use of a liquid sorbent in a traditional Haber–Bosch process enables significant improvements in energy efficiency and potential cost savings for arguably the most important chemical process on the planet. The approach presented in this report employs an incompressible liquid sorbent that absorbs and releases ammonia (NH3) under specific conditions. To achieve this, we investigate reactions of ammonia and pure phosphoric acid (H3PO4, PA), which rapidly neutralize to form an equilibrated solution of monoammonium phosphate (MAP) and diammonium phosphate (DAP) that functions as a reversible and regenerable sorbent. Through intimate contact of the gas-phase Haber–Bosch reaction mixture with this liquid absorbent, complete equilibrium uptake may be achieved in an appropriately sized separator, and facile separation occurs through the use of independent liquid and gas phases. Following dep","au":["Nicholas E. Thornburg","Jacob H. Miller","William Xi","Hai Long","Kathleen D. Brown","Cheyenne Paeper"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"液相吸附增强哈伯-博施法","zb":"研究利用纯磷酸（H3PO4）与氨反应生成磷酸一铵和磷酸二铵作为可逆液相吸附剂。通过气液接触实现氨的完全平衡吸附与分离，仅需重新加压液体即可循环。实验验证了该策略的可行性，并建立了热力学关系，ReaxFF模拟和工艺建模表明其能显著提升哈伯-博施法的能效。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c06704","t":"Cation-Induced Coulombic Enhancement of Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia by Metalloporphyrins","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c06704","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-10-28","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrocatalytic conversion of environmental nitrate (NO 3 – ) to high-value ammonia (NH 3 ) is highly attractive, yet remains a significant challenge. Although metalloporphyrins are widely used in various electrocatalytic reactions due to their unique M-N 4 structure, their application for the nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) has been rarely investigated. In this work, we investigated the catalytic activity of transition metal 4,4′,4″,4‴-(porphyrin-5,10,15,20-tetrayl)tetrakis( N, N, N -trimethylbenzenaminium) (MTMA) complexes, incorporating Fe, Co, Ni, or Cu centers, toward the NO 3 RR. The catalytic performance of the MTMAs decreased in the order: CoTMA > CuTMA > FeTMA > NiTMA. CoTMA exhibited the highest catalytic activity, achieving a maximum NH 3 Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 94.7% and a peak NH 3 yield rate of 366 μmol h –1 cm –2 . The NH 3 yield rate of CoTMA was 1.1, 1.3, a","au":["Hai Sun","Wenwen Zhang","Yuanyuan Qi","Qiang Xu","Jingwei Han","Rui Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"阳离子诱导的库仑增强金属卟啉电催化硝酸根还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸根还原反应（NO3RR），关键方法为制备过渡金属 4,4′,4″,4‴-(porphyrin-5,10,15,20-tetrayl)tetrakis( N, N, N -trimethylbenzenaminium) (MTMA) 络合物，并测试其对 NO3RR 的催化活性。CoTMA 表现出最高活性，最大 NH3 法拉第效率 94.7%，峰值 NH3 产率速率 366 μmol h–1 cm–2。理论计算表明 CoTMA 的活性主要源于其与 *NHO 中间体的强相互作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-7807562/v1","t":"Au Induced Hydrogen Spillover on Au-TiO 2 for Highly Selective Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-7807562/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2025-10-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The localized surface plasma resonance induced hydrogenation is widely used in the chemical synthesis. However, the hydrogen (H 2 ) activation on plasma metal and its immigration process is ambiguous on the metal-oxides interface. Here, the theoretical studies show that the plasma metal (Au) on TiO 2 can generate a strong electric field at metal-oxides interface due to charge enrichment. The ultra-vis spectrums show that this charge enrichment feature promotes the metal-hydrogen bond formation on Au-TiO 2 . The in-situ Raman shows that the formed Ti-H bond demonstrates the active H* transformation from Au to TiO 2 , and further activate the NH 3 synthesis. As a result, the Au-TiO 2 shows high nitrate conversion of 75% and selectivity of NH 3 of 82%. This work provides a new approach to disclose the relationship between catalytic performance and charge state on catalysts.","au":["Ming Dai","Kaishi Wu","Yuehan Li","Yangweinan Cai","Heyan Tian","Yanli Du"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"Au 诱导的氢溢流在 Au-TiO2 上用于高选择性氨合成","zb":"研究对象为 Au-TiO2 催化剂，关键方法为理论研究和光谱表征，主要结果为 Au-TiO2 表现出 75% 的硝酸盐转化率和 82% 的 NH3 选择性。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5se01117e","t":"Magnetically recoverable high-entropy alloy catalyst in carbon matrix for ammonia borane-driven hydrogen evolution and electrocatalytic hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5se01117e","s":"Sustainable Energy & Fuels","d":"2025-10-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Designing multimodal high entropy alloy based catalysts with high efficiency and durability for ammonia borane hydrolysis as well as electrochemical hydrogen evolution from water.","au":["Manish Ramesh Shingole","Siddhartha Kolay","Asheesh Kumar","P. Ruz","V. Sudarsan","Seemita Banerjee"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aic.70132","t":"The effect of geometric configuration on fullerene and Fe tandem catalyst for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.70132","s":"AIChE Journal","d":"2025-10-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"Abstract The development of efficient catalysts enabling the Haber–Bosch ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis process under mild conditions is crucial. However, the competitive activation of co‐adsorbates, that is, excessive N 2 or H 2 binding at a single active site, is detrimental to NH 3 synthesis. Herein, we demonstrate that Fe 2 O 3 mediated by fullerenes (C 60 /C 70 ) with varying geometric configurations could facilitate efficient NH 3 synthesis under mild conditions (≤400°C, ≤2 MPa). Our studies indicate that C 70 exhibits a higher curvature than C 60 , which enhances electron transfer through Fe–O–C bridges. This curvature‐driven electronic modulation, combined with the spatially separated activation of N 2 (primarily on Fe sites) and H 2 (mainly on C 60 /C 70 ), synergistically enhances the dissociation of N 2 and the desorption of NH 3 . As a consequence, the developed C 70 ‐Fe 2 O 3 ach","au":["Ruishao Mao","Mengqi An","Xuanbei Peng","Tianhua Zhang","Ming Chen","Lei Zhang"],"o":"回填","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"几何构型对富勒烯和Fe串联催化剂合成氨的影响","zb":"研究利用不同几何构型的富勒烯（C60/C70）介导Fe2O3，在温和条件下（≤400 °C，≤2 MPa）促进氨合成。C70较高的曲率增强了通过Fe-O-C桥的电子转移，实现了N2和H2的空间分离活化，协同促进N2解离和NH3脱附。C70-Fe2O3催化剂的氨合成率达到19.10 mmol g−1 h−1。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-025-64482-z","t":"Confinement-enhanced valorization of contaminants in electrified hydrogenation membranes for water purification","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-64482-z","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2025-10-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic hydrogenation offers an environmentally benign approach for contaminant valorization, but suffers from sluggish mass and electron transfer. Electrified membranes (EMs) represent an effective strategy to address these challenges, yet their structure-performance relationship remains inadequately understood. Here, we develop EMs featuring atomically dispersed Ru sites, enabling the efficient hydrogenation of nitrate, trichloroacetic acid, and phenol. A volcano-shaped relationship is observed between electrocatalytic activity and pore size. The EM with a pore size of 7 μm (EM 7 ) achieves 94% nitrate removal within 55 s, exhibiting over 97% selectivity towards ammonium and a 2.5 times higher kinetic constant (2.7 min −1 ) than that of EM with 80 μm pores (EM 80 ). However, further reducing the pore diameter to 4 μm diminishes performance. Multiphysics simulations re","au":["Yuyang Kang","Zhenao Gu","Wei Zhang","Baiwen Ma","Chenghai Lu","Chengzhi Hu"],"o":"回填","zt":"约束增强的污染物 valorization 在电化学加氢膜中用于水净化","zb":"研究对象为具有原子分散 Ru 位点的电化学膜，关键方法为电催化活性测试和多物理场模拟，主要结果为 EM7 膜在 55 秒内实现 94% 的硝酸盐去除，选择性为 97%，动力学常数为 2.7 min-1。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c03948","t":"Dual Role of Vacancies in the Degradation and Stabilization of β-MoO 3 Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c03948","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2025-10-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Transition metal oxides (TMOs) are widely employed in electrochemical energy conversion, yet their surface structures are prone to degradation and reconstruction under operating conditions, which significantly undermines catalytic stability and service life. In this work, we systematically investigate the coupling relationship between surface oxygen vacancy configurations and catalytic activity/structural stability in β-MoO 3 during the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR). Our results reveal that specific oxygen vacancies, such as the OVS-3 type with undercoordinated Mo centers, markedly enhance N 2 adsorption and facilitate the initial hydrogenation step, thereby enabling more favorable NRR pathways. However, ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) simulations show that these highly active configurations are thermodynamically unstable and prone to surface reconstruction, leading to the deteri","au":["Dian Song","Cheng Liu","Youyong Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"β-MoO3 电化学氮还原催化剂中空位的降解与稳定双重作用","zb":"本研究系统研究了β-MoO3在氮还原反应中表面氧空位构型与催化活性/结构稳定性的耦合关系。发现特定氧空位能增强N2吸附并促进初始氢化步骤，但热力学不稳定易导致表面重构。通过引入Cr和W等过渡金属进行单原子掺杂，在保持电子结构的同时显著提高了表面热稳定性并抑制了析氢反应。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1109/naps66256.2025.11272236","t":"Viability of Green Ammonia Production in an Islanded Microgrid","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/naps66256.2025.11272236","s":"2025 57th North American Power Symposium (NAPS)","d":"2025-10-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"One of the main methods of decarbonization cited at the moment is known as \"green hydrogen\", or the production of hydrogen, or hydrogen carriers, via the process of electrolysis, which may then be turned back into energy via the use of fuel cells. One potential site for this which can have a great deal of potential is Alaskan hydroelectric sites. Alaskan dams, like others in the Pacific Northwest region, spill significantly during Summer and still have enough reserves to power their entire community on almost exclusively hydroelectric sources. Spilled water represents lost potential energy that could instead be stored seasonally or used in other applications, such as marine or automotive fuels. They have a large potential reserve in their dams, each of which spills significantly from the months of June to December, and are capable of producing between 230 and 3300 metric tons of ammonia,","au":["Matthew Egan","Mohammed Benidris"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"孤岛微电网中绿色氨生产的可行性","zb":"本文评估了阿拉斯加水电站在夏季弃水条件下生产绿色氨的可行性。研究利用伯努利原理评估全年弃水量，计算显示其具备生产230至3300公吨氨的能力，远超当前消费水平。该方案可为公用事业带来10万至160万美元的额外年收入，并利用当地码头建立潜在市场。"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5652450","t":"Electrified Catalytic Decomposition of Methane to Hydrogen, Graphite and Carbon Nanotubes over Ni-Fe-Cr-Co Nanoparticles by Magnetic Induction Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5652450","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-10-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Sergey Girshevich","Stanislav Yakushkin","Sašo Gyergyek","Janvit Teržan","Anja Sedminek","Anej Blažič"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrified Catalytic"],"zt":"磁感应加热下 Ni-Fe-Cr-Co 纳米颗粒对甲烷的电催化分解制备氢气、石墨和碳纳米管","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta06839h","t":"Balancing atomic hydrogen supply and nitrate electroreduction for enhanced ammonia synthesis on Pt-Cu 2 O/Cu electrocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta06839h","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-10-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Pt-Cu 2 O/Cu electrocatalysts achieve efficient nitrate-to-ammonia conversion by balancing atomic hydrogen supply from Pt sites with nitrate hydrogenation at stabilized Cu + sites.","au":["Xiaolong Zhu","Rong Chen","Jiahao Tao","Siyi Liang","Kai Zhang","Wenzheng Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"平衡原子氢供应和硝酸盐电还原以增强 Pt-Cu2O/Cu 电催化剂上的氨合成","zb":"研究对象为 Pt-Cu2O/Cu 电催化剂，关键方法为电催化活性测试，主要结果为通过平衡原子氢供应和硝酸盐加氢实现高效的硝酸盐到氨的转化。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cc05840f","t":"CoSe 2 hollow nanoboxes for enhanced electrocatalytic nitrate reduction toward ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cc05840f","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2025-10-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work highlights a hollow-nanostructure favoring reaction kinetics and cyclability, which would enlighten rational electrode design for nitrate-to-NH 3 conversion.","au":["Lingchang Wang","Zhiwei Wang","Mingying Chen","Yingying Huang","Imran Shakir","Longchao Zhuo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于增强电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨的CoSe2中空纳米盒","zb":"该工作展示了有利于反应动力学和循环性的中空纳米结构，为硝酸盐向NH3转化的理性电极设计提供了思路。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1055/a-2705-8871","t":"Additive- and Catalyst-free Deoxygenative Reduction of Amides and Imides to Amines with Ammonia Borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1055/a-2705-8871","s":"Synlett","d":"2025-10-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The reduction of carbonyl compounds is one of the most fundamental and useful transformations in synthetic chemistry. However, due to the high resonance stability of the amide group, reducing amide compounds is difficult and always requires harsh reductants and/or additional catalysts/additives. In this report, we describe a catalyst-free, additive-free protocol for the deoxygenative reduction of amides using ammonia borane as a mild reductant. Tertiary, secondary, and primary amides, as well as challenging imides can be reduced to the corresponding amines under these conditions. Additionally, the transformation performed well in open air, making the method more practical.","au":["Ke Xu","Min-Jie Zhou","Xinrui Liu","Guofei Chen","Yinjun Xie"],"o":"回填","zt":"无添加剂和催化剂的酰胺和酰亚胺脱氧还原为胺与氨硼烷","zb":"研究对象为酰胺和酰亚胺，关键方法为使用氨硼烷作为温和还原剂进行脱氧还原，制备条件为催化剂和添加剂-free，主要结果为三级、二级和一级酰胺以及具有挑战性的酰亚胺可以在这些条件下还原为相应的胺，转化在开放空气中表现良好，更实用。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202503496","t":"High‐Throughput Synthesis of Mn‐Based Disordered Rock‐Salt Li‐Ion Cathodes with Improved Rate Capability via Rapid Joule‐Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202503496","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-10-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract Manganese‐based disordered rock‐salt (Mn‐DRX) cathodes provide high energy density and exceptional compositional tunability, which enables the rational design and discovery of advanced DRX chemistries. However, exploration across the vast Mn‐DRX design space remains hindered by the slow and energy‐intensive nature of traditional synthesis methods. Here, the Joule‐heating (JH) method is demonstrated to enable rapid and energy‐efficient synthesis of high‐performance Mn‐DRX cathodes. Through a case study of Li 1.2 Mn 0.4 Ti 0.4 O 2 (LMTO), we show that optimizing DRX materials under rapid synthesis requires controlling both nanoscale short‐range ordering (SRO) and microscale features such as bulk homogeneity and impurity phases, highlighting that microscale features are as critical as SRO. Based on this understanding, we show that a JH‐synthesized LMTO (annealed at 1050 °C just for","au":["Sang‐Wook Park","Hojoon Kim","Sangwook Han","Kyoung Sun Kim","You‐Yeob Song","Hyun‐Gi Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"通过快速闪热法高通量合成 Mn 基无序岩盐 Li 离子正极材料并提升倍率性能","zb":"Mn 基无序岩盐 (Mn-DRX) 正极材料具有高能量密度和优异的成分可调性。通过闪热法 (JH) 实现快速、节能的合成。以 Li 1.2 Mn 0.4 Ti 0.4 O 2 (LMTO) 为例，JH 合成的 LMTO (1050 °C, 10 min) 与炉内合成 (950 °C, 12 h) 相比，具有近单相 DRX 结构、均匀元素分布和降低的短程有序 (SRO)，倍率性能从 137 mAh g −1 提高到 161 mAh g −1 (1 A/g)。JH 系统合成的多种 DRX 组成物电化学性能与炉内合成相当，展示了其通用性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.20517/cs.2024.176","t":"Recent progress in ammonia production via plasma-electrocatalysis cascade system","u":"https://doi.org/10.20517/cs.2024.176","s":"Chemical Synthesis","d":"2025-10-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is widely utilized in agriculture to manufacture fertilizers and is an important feedstock in the pharmaceutical, metallurgical, and textile industries. Owing to its highly compressible nature, NH3 is also regarded as an ideal carbon-free hydrogen carrier for the next-generation fuel cells. The Haber-Bosch process is currently the main method for NH3 production but suffers from high energy consumption and intensive carbon emission. Recently, the plasma-electrochemical cascade pathway - plasma nitrogen fixation from air in tandem with electrocatalytic synthesis of NH3 - has emerged as an alternative by the simplified process, low carbon emission, and high NH3 yield. However, the research in this area has not been summarized timely. This review systematically summarizes the research progress of plasma-electrochemical cascade pathway for the first time. Through performance and","au":["Chenghao Yang","Xin Xiao","Wanglai Cen","Jinyu Liu","Jing Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"等离子体-电催化级联系统合成氨的最新进展","zb":"综述了等离子体-电化学级联路径在合成氨领域的最新研究进展。该路径通过空气等离子体固氮与电催化合成NH3相结合，具有流程简化、低碳排放和高产率优势。文章分析了性能与能耗，指出了提高等离子体固氮效率和电合成NH3效率的关键问题，并提供了相应的优化策略。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1155/er/5059401","t":"Ammonia Synthesis via Synergistic Plasma–Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1155/er/5059401","s":"International Journal of Energy Research","d":"2025-10-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"We report ambient‐condition ammonia synthesis via plasma‐mediated electrocatalysis that couples a nonthermal plasma (NTP) with an electrochemical cell. In this hybrid scheme, the plasma pregenerates long‐lived, soluble nitrogen intermediates (predominantly NO 3 − /NO 2 − ) from N 2 /H 2 O, which are subsequently electrochemically reduced to NH 3 . Using a dual‐chamber H‐cell (2.5 kV NTP, ~6–7 mA plasma current; −0.5 V vs. Ag/AgCl), we find that Ar plasma doubles NH 3 production relative to electrochemistry alone, and N 2 plasma provides a further approximately 50% increase. Acidic electrolytes are critical: 0.5 M H 2 SO 4 maximizes NH 3 yield, while tuning acid concentration balances NH 3 selectivity against HER. Humidifying the N 2 plasma increases nitrate from approximately 5400 to approximately 7100 ppm and boosts NH 3 by approximately 21%, consistent with enhanced formation of solubl","au":["Snigdha Rashinkar","Jie Hu","Majid A. Ali","Xinfang Jin","Fuqiang Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过协同等离子体-电化学氮还原合成氨","zb":"研究对象为氨合成，关键方法为将非热等离子体(NTP)与电化学电池耦合，使用双室H-电池(2.5 kV NTP, ~6–7 mA等离子体电流; −0.5 V vs. Ag/AgCl)，主要结果为氩等离子体使氨产量相对于单独电化学增加一倍，氮等离子体再增加约50%，0.5 M H 2 SO 4 电解质最大化氨产率，调节酸浓度平衡氨选择性与析氢反应(HER)，湿润氮等离子体使硝酸盐从约5400增加到约7100 ppm，氨增加约21%，PtIr和Pd优于Pt/C、NbN和NbO 2 ，表明在等离子体辅助下，速率限制步骤从硝酸盐活化转变为氢化，有利于有效提供表面氢的催化剂，Faradaic效率(FE)最高达47%，总比能耗为约73 kWh/kg NH 3 ，主要受等离子体输入影响。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c04274","t":"High-Performance Fe–MoS 2 Electrocatalyst for Efficient Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia: Synergistic Design for Sustainable Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c04274","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2025-10-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate (NO3 –) to ammonia (NH3) offers a promising route for both environmental remediation and sustainable ammonia production, yet current catalysts are limited by low efficiency and selectivity. Inspired by the active sites of nitrate reductase enzymes, this study reports the development of a high-performance electrocatalyst based on iron atoms supported on molybdenum disulfide nanosheets (Fe–MoS2), deposited on carbon felt. The Fe–MoS2 catalyst demonstrates a synergistic effect, achieving superior selectivity and productivity for NH3 synthesis from nitrate under neutral pH and realistic wastewater conditions (500 ppm of NO3 –). Electrochemical testing reveals a maximal Faradaic efficiency of 80% at – 0.53 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) and a peak NH3 yield rate of 411 μg h–1 cm–2 at – 0.98 V versus RHE. The straightforward synthesis ","au":["N. Marino","R. G. Milazzo","R. Farina","C. Bongiorno","G. Fisicaro","S. Libertino"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"高效硝酸还原为氨的铁-二硫化钼电催化剂：协同设计用于可持续氨生产","zb":"研究对象为硝酸还原为氨，关键方法为开发基于碳毡上负载的Fe-二硫化钼纳米片(Fe–MoS2)的高性能电催化剂，制备方法为两步电沉积和滴涂技术，主要结果为Fe–MoS2催化剂在中性pH和实际废水条件下(500 ppm的NO3 –)表现出协同效应，最大Faradaic效率为80% at – 0.53 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE)，峰值氨产率率为411 μg h–1 cm–2 at – 0.98 V versus RHE，与单组分催化剂(MoS2或Fe单独)的比较研究证实了Fe–MoS2系统的性能增强。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cc05026j","t":"The sulfur-anchored Joule heating synthesis of ultrasmall nanoalloys to enhance oxygen electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cc05026j","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2025-10-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Pt-based alloys have been recognized as appealing candidates for use in the oxygen reduction reaction, yet they still suffer from serious particle sintering and poor size uniformity. Here, we developed a sulfur-anchored Joule heating strategy to prepare a PtCo alloy with an average particle size of only 2.9 nm. The strong interaction between metal and S favored the stabilization of S onto the carbon support, contributing to the uniform distribution of PtCo nanoparticles. The obtained PtCo nanoparticles exhibited a half-wave potential of 0.941 V vs. RHE, significantly higher than commercial Pt/C.","au":["Shuai Wei","Xiao-Yan Huang","Yi Zhang","Yao-Lin A","Jie Wei","Yan Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"硫锚定的闪热法合成超小纳米合金以增强氧电还原","zb":"Pt 基合金在氧还原反应中是很有吸引力的候选材料，但仍存在严重的颗粒烧结和尺寸不均匀问题。开发了硫锚定的闪热策略制备 PtCo 合金，平均粒径仅为 2.9 nm。金属与 S 的强相互作用有利于 S 在碳载体上的稳定，促进了 PtCo 纳米颗粒的均匀分布。所得 PtCo 纳米颗粒半波电位为 0.941 V vs. RHE，显著高于商业 Pt/C。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1038/s44286-025-00284-w","t":"A lightbulb moment for ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44286-025-00284-w","s":"Nature Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":21,"ab":"","au":["Qijun Pei","Ping Chen"],"o":"回填","w":["Ping Chen"],"why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"一个灯泡时刻用于氨分解","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1038/s44286-025-00283-x","t":"Ultra-fast ammonia decomposition using an electrified tungsten wire lightbulb reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44286-025-00283-x","s":"Nature Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia decomposition is a key reaction in the green hydrogen economy as ammonia is an important carbon-free hydrogen carrier. Despite extensive efforts to develop active catalysts to address the reaction's slow kinetics, we introduce a tungsten wire lightbulb reactor that operates at unconventionally high temperatures with enhanced efficiency. Near the wire, temperature reaches up to 1,800 K, enabling ultra-fast ammonia decomposition with rate constants much higher than those of leading catalysts under typical reaction conditions. Concurrently, the sharp temperature decrease along the radial direction allows for low power inputs, thus enhancing energy efficiency. It also realized up to 99.995% conversion at enhanced power input without the use of membrane separation. We further discuss a scale-up reactor design that is two to three orders of magnitude smaller than current state","au":["Keshia Saradima Indriadi","Sie Shing Wong","Peijie Han","Sikai Wang","Di Xu","Ning Yan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"使用通电钨丝灯泡反应器进行超快氨分解","zb":"研究对象为氨分解，关键方法为使用通电钨丝灯泡反应器，在非常高的温度下运行，增强效率，主要结果为靠近钨丝处温度高达1,800 K，实现超快氨分解，速率常数远高于领先催化剂在典型反应条件下的速率常数，径向方向温度急剧下降，允许低功率输入，从而提高能源效率，在增强功率输入下实现高达99.995%的转化率，而无需膜分离。","ob":"氨分解制氢","pp":"Research Square","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/chem.202502611","t":"π‐π Conjugated g‐C 16 N 19 Skeleton‐Supported Single‐Atom Catalyst for Nitrogen Reduction Reaction: A “Lock and Key” Coevaluation of Activity and Selectivity Involved in Constant Potential and pH Effect","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.202502611","s":"Chemistry – A European Journal","d":"2025-10-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The efficient development of electrocatalysts for the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) under ambient conditions has been greatly challenging due to the high stability of the N≡N bond and the competitive interference from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). This work innovatively designs a graphitic carbon nitride substrate (g‐C 16 N 19 ) with a super‐large pore structure based on the self‐doping strategy and first‐principles calculations, and constructs TM@g‐C 16 N 19 (TM = Ti ∼ Au) single‐atom catalyst systems. By establishing a “Four‐Step” screening model, it is found that W@g‐C 16 N 19 exhibits the best NRR catalytic performance, with an ultralow limiting potential (U L ) of ‐0.23 V. Combining electron structure analyses such as charge density difference, ICOHP value, Bader charge, and spin magnetic moment, the micro‐mechanism of W@g‐C 16 N 19 effectively activating the σ","au":["Yali Lu","Zongjin Hu","Qiang Zhang","Chenglong Shi","Qingjun Zhou","Yuling Song"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"π-π共轭g-C 16 N 19 骨架负载的单原子催化剂用于氮还原反应：恒电位和pH效应涉及的活性和选择性‘锁和钥匙’协同评估","zb":"研究对象为氮还原反应(NRR)，关键方法为基于自掺杂策略和第一性原理计算设计具有超大面积结构的石墨相氮化碳骨架(g‐C 16 N 19 )，构建TM@g‐C 16 N 19 (TM = Ti ∼ Au)单原子催化剂系统，使用‘四步’筛选模型，主要结果为W@g‐C 16 N 19 表现出最佳NRR催化性能，极限电位(U L )为 ‐0.23 V，通过电荷密度差、ICOHP值、Bader电荷和自旋磁矩等电子结构分析，揭示了W@g‐C 16 N 19 通过强d‐p轨道杂化有效活化N 2 分子的σ/π键的微观机制，pH-电位耦合分析表明配置对活性有决定性影响：E‐I/S‐V模式在碱性介质中占主导，而E‐O/S‐O途径在酸性条件下占主导。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1111/jace.70308","t":"Joule heating‐driven ultrafast synthesis of high‐entropy MAX phase as a robust electromagnetic wave absorber","u":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jace.70308","s":"Journal of the American Ceramic Society","d":"2025-10-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract MAX phases can benefit from high‐entropy (HE) effects to enhance their electromagnetic (EM) wave absorption properties. This study introduces Joule heating‐driven ultrafast synthesis (JHUS) for the first time to synthesize the novel HE‐MAX phase (Ti 1/5 Nb 1/5 Ta 1/5 Hf 1/5 V 1/5 ) 2 AlC at 1200°C in 20 s. The high‐entropy effects, combined with the JHUS, lead to the formation of structural defects within the HE‐MAX phase, such as lattice distortions, dislocations, and point defects. These structural defects play a crucial role in promoting dipole polarization. The high aspect ratio of the layered structure promotes electron transfer and interfacial polarization. These effects result in a significant improvement in EM wave absorption, with a minimum reflection loss of −46.07 dB at 2.7 mm and a 4.08 GHz absorption bandwidth at 1.5 mm. This study demonstrates an efficient and rapi","au":["Yuhang Bai","Yang Yang","Zelong Yao","Jinrui Li","Jia Liu","Peipei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动的超快合成高熵 MAX 相作为稳健的电磁波吸收体","zb":"MAX 相可以通过高熵效应增强其电磁波吸收性能。本研究首次引入焦耳热驱动的超快合成 (JHUS) 方法，在 1200°C 下 20 秒内合成了新型高熵 MAX 相 (Ti 1/5 Nb 1/5 Ta 1/5 Hf 1/5 V 1/5 ) 2 AlC。高熵效应结合 JHUS 导致高熵 MAX 相内部形成结构缺陷，如晶格畸变、位错和点缺陷。这些结构缺陷在促进偶极极化方面起着关键作用。层状结构的高的长径比促进了电子转移和界面极化。这些效应显著提高了电磁波吸收性能，在 2.7 mm 处最小反射损失为 −46.07 dB，在 1.5 mm 处吸收带宽为 4.08 GHz。本研究展示了一种高效快速合成高熵 MAX 相的方法，并探索了高熵工程在优化其电磁波吸收中的作用。"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c11655","t":"Rational Design of Conductive MOF-Based Diatomic Electrocatalysts for Selective Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11655","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-10-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Diatomic catalysts (DACs) have recently attracted emerging attention beyond single-atom catalysts (SACs) in achieving targeted catalytic performance, yet their rational design and synthesis remain challenging. Here, we demonstrate the feasibility of designing DACs for highly selective ammonia synthesis from nitrate by developing a water-stable conductive metal-organic framework (cMOF) with a tunable Cu and Ni node (CuxNiy-DBCO) used as a platform catalyst. The well-defined diatomic structure of the cMOFs and adjustable metal components enable systematic identification of active diatomic species and elucidation of the underlying nitrate reduction mechanism. Based on this understanding, we successfully design and synthesize a targeted DACs catalyst (Cu98.5Ni1.5-DBCO) to exhibit unit of selectivity accompanied with ammonia yields of over 200 mg h-1 mgcat-1 (3.5 mmol h-1 cm-2) at a current d","au":["Qinglin Li","Chunmei Jia","Qianxiao Wang","Xiangyang Guo","Kun Qi","Jinfeng Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"导电 MOF 基双原子电催化剂的合理设计用于选择性氨合成","zb":"双原子催化剂 (DACs) 最近在实现靶向催化性能方面引起了新兴的关注，但其合理设计和合成仍然具有挑战性。本研究展示了设计 DACs 用于从硝酸盐合成氨的可行性，通过开发一种水稳定的导电金属有机框架 (cMOF) 与可调的 Cu 和 Ni 节点 (CuxNiy-DBCO) 用于作为平台催化剂。cMOFs 的明确双原子结构和可调节的金属组分使系统能够识别活性双原子物种并阐明潜在的硝酸盐还原机制。基于这种理解，成功设计和合成了一种靶向 DACs 催化剂 (Cu98.5Ni1.5-DBCO) 以表现出单位选择性，氨产率为超过 200 mg h-1 mgcat-1 (3.5 mmol h-1 cm-2) 在电流密度 >750 mA cm-2 处。一个 Zn-NO3- 电池结合这种优化的 DACs 作为阴极提供功率密度为 35.6 mW cm-2，突出了导电 MOFs 在开发靶向 DACs 用于工业","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/molecules30204131","t":"Machine Learning-Assisted DFT Screening of Nitrogen-Doped Graphene Diatomic Catalysts for Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules30204131","s":"Molecules","d":"2025-10-20","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This research seeks to investigate extremely efficient catalysts for the nitrogen reduction process (NRR), utilizing machine learning (ML)-aided density functional theory (DFT) computations. Specifically, we investigate dual transition metal atoms anchored on hexagonal nitrogen-doped graphene (TM1-TM2@N6G) as prospective high-activity catalysts for the NRR. The findings indicate that the synergistic effect of dual transition metal atoms in the TM1-TM2@N6G catalyst overcomes the intrinsic constraints of the linear relationship among intermediates, facilitating the activation and adsorption of N2, thereby exhibiting significant potential for ammonia synthesis through N2 reduction. Particularly, four catalysts screened by ML and DFT exhibit good stability and excellent selectivity and activation towards N2. Among them, the catalysts Ti-Cr@N6G, Ti-Mo@N6G, and Ti-Pd@N6G possess two reaction p","au":["Xiulin Wang","Suofu Nie","Huichao Yao","Sida Wu","Yanze Li","Junli Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"机器学习辅助的 DFT 筛选氮掺杂石墨烯双原子催化剂用于氮还原反应","zb":"本研究利用机器学习 (ML)-辅助的密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算研究氮还原过程 (NRR) 的极其高效的催化剂。具体来说，我们研究了锚定在六元氮掺杂石墨烯 (TM1-TM2@N6G) 上的双过渡金属原子作为 NRR 的高活性催化剂的潜力。研究结果表明，TM1-TM2@N6G 催化剂中双过渡金属原子的协同效应克服了中间体之间线性关系的内在限制，促进了 N2 的活化和吸附，从而表现出通过 N2 还原合成氨的显著潜力。特别是，ML 和 DFT 筛选的四个催化剂表现出良好的稳定性、优异的选择性和对 N2 的活化。其中，Ti-Cr@N6G、Ti-Mo@N6G 和 Ti-Pd@N6G 具有两种反应路径，最小反应能为 0.55 eV、0.50 eV 和 0.40 eV。值得注意的是，Ti-Co@N6G 具有单一反应路径，反应能低于 0.05 eV，允许 NRR 自发进行。值得注意的是，将 ML 结合到","ob":"涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202516398","t":"An Atomically Precise Ru 1 Au 6 (TBBT) 6 (PPh 3 ) 6 Cluster Catalyst for Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202516398","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-10-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Only one active site in a catalyst is not able to handle a deal of multitasking at once to facilitate distinct elementary steps in a catalytic cycle. To overcome this, a multi‐functional system is required by two or more functional units combined in one catalyst, with each unit playing a complementary role. Here we find that the Au site of Au(TBBT)PPh 3 (TBBT = 4‐ tert ‐butylbenzenethiol) complex not only activates water but also reduces nitrate to ammonia, resulting in a low efficiency for the electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate. To decouple the responsibility of the Au site, we synthesize a Ru 1 Au 6 (TBBT) 6 (PPh 3 ) 6 cluster consisted of one Ru atom and six Au(TBBT)PPh 3 complexes bridged by the S atoms, in which the water dissociation is mostly undertaken on the Ru site for the steady supply of proton, while the nitrate is sequentially reduced on the Au sites. More notab","au":["Jinzhi Lu","Chenyang Shen","Yiqi Tian","Qingxi Zhai","Mingchen Han","Xu Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"用于氨生产的原子精确 Ru 1 Au 6 (TBBT) 6 (PPh 3 ) 6 集簇催化剂","zb":"一个催化剂中只有一个活性位点无法同时处理多项任务以促进催化循环中的不同基元步骤。为了克服这一点，需要一个多功能系统，该系统由两个或多个功能单元组合在一个催化剂中，每个单元都起互补作用。在这里我们发现 Au(TBBT)PPh 3 (TBBT = 4‐叔丁基苯硫醇) 络合物中的 Au 位点不仅活化水，还还原硝酸盐为氨，导致对硝酸盐电催化还原的低效率。为了解耦 Au 位点的责任，我们合成了一种由一个 Ru 原子和六个 Au(TBBT)PPh 3 络合物通过 S 原子桥接组成的 Ru 1 Au 6 (TBBT) 6 (PPh 3 ) 6 集簇，其中水解离主要在 Ru 位点进行以稳定提供质子，而硝酸盐按顺序在 Au 位点还原。更值得注意的是，质子从 Ru 到 Au 通过 S 桥接容易进行，从而在这个集簇中观察到 Ru 位点和六个 Au 位点之间的正协同作用，并且与这个络合物催化剂相比，效率提高了 1","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202513890","t":"Cation‐Engineered Iron Porphyrin Boosting Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrite to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202513890","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-10-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Excessive discharge of nitrite (NO 2 − ) into the natural environment disrupts the nitrogen cycle and poses significant health risks. Metalloporphyrins are recognized as ideal electrocatalysts owing to their well‐defined M─N 4 coordination and tunable structural properties. In this study, iron 4,4′,4′′,4′″‐(porphyrin‐5,10,15,20‐tetrayl)tetrakis(N, N‐dimethylaniline) (FeDMA) and iron 4,4′,4′′,4′″‐(porphyrin‐5,10,15,20‐tetrayl)tetrakis(N, N, N‐trimethylbenzenaminium) (FeTMA) were synthesized from iron tetraphenylporphyrin (FeTPP) by introducing electron‐donating dimethylammonio and electron‐withdrawing trimethylammonio substituents. We systematically investigated the influence of substituent effects on the catalytic activity of iron porphyrins for the nitrite reduction reaction (NO 2 RR). FeTMA achieved exceptional performance, maintaining >90% Faradaic efficiency (FE) for NH 3 ov","au":["Hai Sun","Wenwen Zhang","Yuanyuan Qi","Qiang Xu","Jingwei Han","Jiahui Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"阳离子工程铁卟啉增强亚硝酸盐电催化还原为氨","zb":"亚硝酸盐 (NO 2 − ) 的过度排放到自然环境中扰乱氮循环并构成重大健康风险。金属卟啉由于其明确的 M─N 4 配位和可调的结构特性而被认为是理想的电催化剂。在本研究中，通过引入给电子的二甲氨基和吸电子的三甲氨基取代基，从铁四苯基卟啉 (FeTPP) 合成了铁 4,4′,4′′,4′″‐(卟啉‐5,10,15,20‐四亚基)四-(N, N‐二甲基苯胺) (FeDMA) 和铁 4,4′,4′′,4′″‐(卟啉‐5,10,15,20‐四亚基)四-(N, N, N‐三甲基苄胺) (FeTMA)。我们系统地研究了取代基效应对铁卟啉在亚硝酸盐还原反应 (NO 2 RR) 中催化活性的影响。FeTMA 实现了优异的性能，在较宽的电位范围内 (−1.1 至 −1.5 V 对 Ag/AgCl) 对 NH 3 保持 >90% 的法拉第效率 (FE) 和 458 ± 4 µmol h −1 cm −2 的","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1116/6.0004812","t":"Area selective atomic layer deposition of ruthenium with phenol as a small molecule inhibitor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0004812","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2025-10-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A study on area selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD) of ruthenium was performed using phenol as a small molecule inhibitor (SMI). The surfaces studied were native SiO2, Co, Cu, W, TiN, HfO2, and ZrO2. First, all the surfaces were exposed at 350 °C to 200 exposures of a 15 s pulse of phenol followed by 40 s of N2 purging. Ru film was then deposited using bis(cyclopentadienyl)ruthenium (RuCp2) as a precursor and O2 as a coreactant at 350 °C. The surfaces were characterized by scanning electron microscopy, energy dispersive x-ray spectroscopy, and x-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, and the results show that the extent of the Ru growth inhibition by phenol on the different surfaces depends on their chemical nature. Selective chemisorption of phenol on W, TiN, HfO2, and ZrO2 prevents the Ru film from growing, making them nongrowth surfaces in relation to native SiO2 and Co, which are gro","au":["Sundas Ismaeel","Mykhailo Chundak","Mikko Ritala"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"使用苯酚作为小分子抑制剂的区域选择性原子层沉积 Ru","zb":"研究使用苯酚作为小分子抑制剂（SMI）进行区域选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）的 Ru。在 350 °C 下将天然 SiO2、Co、Cu、W、TiN、HfO2 和 ZrO2 表面暴露于 200 次苯酚 15 s 脉冲和 40 s N2 清洗后，使用 bis(cyclopentadienyl)ruthenium (RuCp2) 作为前驱体和 O2 作为共反应剂在 350 °C 下沉积 Ru 薄膜。通过扫描电子显微镜、能量色散 X 射线光谱和 X 射线光电子能谱表征表面，结果表明苯酚在不同表面的 Ru 生长抑制程度取决于其化学性质。苯酚在 W、TiN、HfO2 和 ZrO2 上的选择性吸附防止 Ru 薄膜生长，使这些表面成为与天然 SiO2 和 Co（生长表面 GSs）相关的非生长表面。所有 GSs 对 W 和 TiN 的选择性大于 0.8，持续 1000 个 Ru ALD 周期；对 ZrO2","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.15541/jim20250211","t":"Co-Mg Synergistic Carbon Nano Onions Catalyst: Preparation and Low-temperature Catalytic Hydrogen Production from Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.15541/jim20250211","s":"Journal of Inorganic Materials","d":"2025-10-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"1,2 ，曾少华 2,3 (1.太原理工大学 材料科学与工程学院，太原 030024; 2. 中新国际联合研究院, 广州 510555；3.南洋理工大学机械与 航空航天工程学院，新加坡 639798) 摘 要: 氨分解制氢作为一种极具前景的氢气制备方法，其关键在于开发具有高活性、高选择性和低成本的中低温 催化剂。本研究以甲烷 850 ℃裂解制氢副产物纳米洋葱碳(CNOs)为载体，采用均匀沉积沉淀法负载活性金属钴 (Co)，并引入碱金属氧化镁(MgO)作助剂，成功制备了高性能氨分解催化剂。通过系统研究酸洗及钾(K)活 化处理对 CNOs 载体形貌的调控作用，深入探究了其对催化剂性能的影响机制。结合多种表征与化学吸附实验，","au":["Xinyan XUE","Xiaowei ZHANG","Heng LU","Shijie LI","Weike ZHANG","Siewhwa CHAN"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"Co-Mg协同碳纳米洋葱催化剂：制备及氨分解制氢的低温催化","zb":"本研究以甲烷裂解副产物纳米洋葱碳为载体，采用均匀沉积沉淀法制备了负载钴并引入氧化镁助剂的催化剂。通过酸洗及钾活化处理调控载体形貌，系统研究了其对催化剂性能的影响机制。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c03275","t":"Architecting Cobalt-Centered 2D Sandwich-Type Polyoxometalate Frameworks for Selective Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c03275","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2025-10-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Developing efficient electrocatalysts for neutral-media nitrate reduction (NO3-RR) is crucial for simultaneous nitrate remediation and sustainable ammonia (NH3) synthesis, yet hindered by sluggish reaction kinetics. Herein, we designed and synthesized four novel two-dimensional (2D) cobalt-centered hourglass-shaped [P4Mo6VO31]12--based crystalline materials via the hydrothermal method: (H2bimb)2[Co3{Mo6O15(HPO4)3(PO4)}2]·7H2O (1), (H2bimb)2[Co3{Mo6O15(HPO4)3(PO4)}2]·16H2O (2), [{Co(Hbimb)2}2][{Co(H2O)2}Co{Mo6O15(HPO4)2(PO4)2}2]·10H2O (3), and (H2bimb)2[Co(Hbimb)2][{Co(H2O)2}2Co{Mo6O15(HPO4)2(PO4)2}2]·18H2O (4) (bimb = 1,3-bis(1H-imidazol-1-yl)benzene), featuring tunable hourglass-type [P4Mo6VO31]12- clusters. The experimental results showed that compounds 1-4 all exhibited better NO3-RR performance, among which compound 4 exhibited excellent stability and outstanding redox activity perfo","au":["Hui Luo","Xinming Wang","Qiushuang Jiang","Gang Li","Xiaojuan Ren","Haijun Pang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"构筑钴中心二维夹层型多酸金属有机框架用于选择性电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"设计并合成了四种新型二维钴中心沙漏形[P4Mo6VO31]12--基晶体材料，通过水热法制备：(H2bimb)2[Co3{Mo6O15(HPO4)3(PO4)}2]·7H2O (1), (H2bimb)2[Co3{Mo6O15(HPO4)3(PO4)}2]·16H2O (2), [{Co(Hbimb)2}2][{Co(H2O)2}Co{Mo6O15(HPO4)2(PO4)2}2]·10H2O (3), 和 (H2bimb)2[Co(Hbimb)2][{Co(H2O)2}2Co{Mo6O15(HPO4)2(PO4)2}2]·18H2O (4) (bimb = 1,3-双(1H-咪唑-1-基)苯)，具有可调的沙漏型[P4Mo6VO31]12-簇。化合物1-4均表现出更好的NO3-RR性能，其中化合物4在-0.7 V (相对于可逆氢电极)下具有89.65%的法拉第效率和8.97 mg h-1 m","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/en18205485","t":"Techno-Economic Assessment of Carbon-Neutral Ammonia Fuel for Ships from Renewable Wind Energy","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en18205485","s":"Energies","d":"2025-10-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Climate change is fuelled by the continued growth of global carbon emissions, with the widespread use of fossil fuels being the main driver. To achieve a decarbonisation transition of the energy mix, the development of clean and renewable fuels has become crucial. Ammonia is seen as an important option for decarbonisation in the transport and energy sectors due to its zero-carbon emission potential and renewable energy compatibility. However, the high energy consumption and carbon emissions of the conventional Haber–Bosch method limit its sustainability. A green ammonia synthesis system was designed using ECLIPSE and Excel simulations in the study. Results show that at a recirculation ratio of 70%, the system’s annual total energy consumption is 426.22 GWh, with annual ammonia production reaching 8342.78 t. The optimal system configuration comprises seven 12 MW offshore wind turbines, in","au":["Yunjing Qi","Yaodong Wang","Ye Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"碳中性船舶氨燃料从可再生风能的技术经济评估","zb":"为应对全球碳排放增长导致的气候变化，研究设计了一个利用可再生风能的绿色氨合成系统，通过ECLIPSE和Excel模拟得出，在70%的循环率下，系统年总能耗为426.22 GWh，年氨产量达8342.78 t，最佳系统配置包括七台12 MW的海上风力涡轮机、460 MWh的锂电池和240 t的氢存储能力，此时LCOE约为£5956.58/t，表明结合可再生能源可显著减少温室气体排放，但需进一步优化储能配置和反应条件以降低成本。"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-srg17","t":"Ternary-Promoted Cobalt Catalyst for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-srg17","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-10-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Development of low-cost catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions is essential for advancing a sustainable society. Traditional approaches, which enhance catalytic activity via addition of alkali and alkaline earth metals to promote electron donation, face fundamental limitations. Here, we demonstrate that Ba, Ce, and Zr synergistically enhance catalytic activity in Co-Mg catalyst systems. These promoters effectively prevent sintering of both Co and MgO nanoparticles, leading to formation of a distinct grape-like nanostructure, where highly dispersed Co nanoparticles are maintained even at high Co loadings. The resulting catalyst exhibits a remarkable ammonia synthesis rate of 36.9 mmol gcat−1 h−1 at 350 °C and 1.0 MPa, positioning it as one of the most advanced non-noble metal catalysts for mild-condition ammonia production.","au":["Takahiro Naito","Katsutoshi Sato","Kanishka De Silva","Takaaki Toriyama","Tomokazu Yamamoto","Ryotaro Aso"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"三元促进钴催化剂用于氨合成","zb":"研究提出Ba、Ce、Zr三元促进剂协同增强Co-Mg催化剂体系活性。这些促进剂防止了Co和MgO纳米颗粒的烧结，形成了独特的葡萄状纳米结构。该催化剂在350 °C和1.0 MPa下表现出36.9 mmol gcat−1 h−1的氨合成率，成为最先进的非贵金属温和条件氨合成催化剂之一。","pre":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-mqtt6","t":"Probing the State of Cobalt in TiO2-Supported CO2 Hydrogenation Catalysts from Tailored Materials Prepared via Atomic Layer Deposition and Surface Organometallic Chemistry","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-mqtt6","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-10-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"TiO2 is ubiquitous as a support in catalytic applications. However, its highly absorptive nature limits the use of transmission-based spectroscopic techniques, such as in situ/operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy, for structure-activity studies. Therefore, a combined atomic layer deposition (ALD) and surface organometallic chemistry (SOMC) approach has been developed to synthesize cobalt nanoparticles (NPs) supported on a TiO2 thin film dispersed on SiO2 affording a spectroscopically accessible Co/TiO2@SiO2 catalyst. Co/TiO2@SiO2 catalyzes methanation similarly to Co/TiO2 and in contrast to Co/SiO2 that favor reverse water gas shift. In situ Co K-edge X-ray absorption spectroscopy during CO2 hydrogenation reveals that cobalt remain fully metallic, consistent with the observed methanation activity. This study shows that combining ALD and SOMC enables the generation of TiO2-supported mod","au":["Zhou Wei","Xiaoyu Zhou","James Paterson","Jamie Southouse","Alexey Fedorov","Christoph R. Müller"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积与表面有机金属化学制备的 TiO2 载体 Co 催化剂 CO2 加氢研究","zb":"采用原子层沉积（ALD）和表面有机金属化学（SOMC）方法制备了 Co/TiO2@SiO2 催化剂。在 CO2 加氢过程中，原位 X 射线吸收光谱显示 Co 保持全金属状态，催化活性与 Co/TiO2 相似。该研究展示了结合 ALD 和 SOMC 研究模型催化剂的可行性。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","pre":1},{"id":"10.53941/photocatalysis.2025.100002","t":"Low-Temperature Photo-Thermal Synthesis of Ammonia over K-Promoted Ru/CeO2 Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.53941/photocatalysis.2025.100002","s":"Photocatalysis","d":"2025-10-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Haber-Bosch process has enabled large-scale ammonia (NH3) production for over a century. Yet, its high energy demand and carbon footprint reinforces the need to develop new approaches for sustainable NH3 synthesis. In this study, a K-promoted Ru/CeO2 catalyst is investigated for photo-thermal NH3 synthesis under continuous flow conditions, leveraging light and heat to enhance catalytic efficiency. The optimized Ru(3)/CeO2 catalyst achieved an NH3 production rate of 20 mmol g⁻1 h⁻1 at 350 °C and 20 bar, representing the highest reported performance for a photo-thermal system. Mechanistic studies revealed that light-driven charge transfer processes accelerate NH3 formation via an associative pathway, as confirmed by in-situ DRIFTS analysis. Notably, the system remained stable for over 50 h without deactivation. Beyond NH3 synthesis, the catalyst also demonstrated high efficiency for photo-","au":["Angel Sousa","Alejandra Rendón-Patiño","Xinhuilan Wang","Diego Mateo","Jorge Gascon"],"o":"回填","why":["Synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"K助剂的Ru/CeO2催化剂在低温下对氨的光热合成","zb":"为应对哈伯-博施工艺的高能耗和碳足迹，研究调查了K助剂的Ru/CeO2催化剂在连续流动条件下进行光热NH3合成的性能，利用光和热提高催化效率。优化的Ru(3)/CeO2催化剂在350 °C和20 bar下实现了20 mmol g⁻1 h⁻1的NH3生产速率，为光热系统报道的最高性能。机理研究表明，光驱动的电荷转移过程通过关联途径加速NH3形成，由原位DRIFTS分析证实。值得注意的是，该系统在50 h内保持稳定，未发生失活。除了NH3合成，该催化剂对光热NH3分解也表现出高效率，在215 °C下实现了656 mmol H2 g⁻1 h⁻1，显著优于传统的热催化方法。这些发现突出了基于Ru/CeO2催化剂的光热NH3合成和分解的潜力，为可持续的基于NH3的能源储存和利用提供了一条有希望的途径。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-9wt9t","t":"Ultralow-concentration nitrate-to-ammonia electroupcycling on Co-decorated Cu-organic nanocomposite for actual wastewater treatment","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-9wt9t","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-10-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical conversion of nitrate to ammonia provides an efficient approach to eliminate nitrate pollutants and produce value-added ammonia. Numerous electrocatalysts have been reported to drive the multi-step process, but most of them perform poorly at ultralow NO3− concentrations in neutral media and lack practical application in real-world wastewater treatment. Here, we developed an inorganic-organic nanocomposite (CuCo-Dtz/Vulcan) via a facile and green one-step coprecipitation method for highly active and selective ammonia formation under low-to-ultralow nitrate concentrations (10, 5, 1 mM) in neutral electrolyte. Cu plays a vital role in initiating the nitrate reduction process, while the introduction of Co significantly accelerates the further reduction steps of nitrogen-containing intermediates by providing H*. Endowed by the synergistic effect between Cu and Co, CuCo-Dtz/Vul","au":["Zhihui Yao","Tian Zeng","Wanying Wang","Tao Zhou","Zhengxiao Guo","Edmund Chun Ming Tse"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"Co修饰的Cu-有机纳米复合材料在低至超低硝酸盐浓度下对氨的实际废水处理中的电循环","zb":"电化学将硝酸盐转化为氨为消除硝酸盐污染物和生产高附加值氨提供了一种高效方法。然而，大多数电催化剂在低至超低NO3−浓度下表现不佳，缺乏在实际废水处理中的实际应用。开发了一种无机-有机纳米复合材料(CuCo-Dtz/Vulcan)，通过简便的绿色一步共沉淀法制备，在低至超低硝酸盐浓度(10, 5, 1 mM)的中性电解质中形成高活性和选择性的氨。Cu在启动硝酸盐还原过程中起关键作用，而Co的引入通过提供H*显著加速了含氮中间体的进一步还原步骤。Cu和Co的协同效应使CuCo-Dtz/Vulcan在10 mM NO3−下具有高达96.2%的最大氨FE(在-0.5 V vs RHE)，在5 mM和1 mM的更低NO3−浓度下，氨FE超过70%。此外，在低硝酸盐浓度(~700 ppm)的实际水培废水中，获得了81.8%的氨FE。在规模化流动电解槽中，CuCo-Dtz/Vulcan成功消除了超过93","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202508642","t":"Phase Engineering of Nickel Phosphides for Simultaneous Enhancement of Activity, Selectivity, and Stability Toward Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202508642","s":"Small","d":"2025-10-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) is a very promising pathway for ammonia synthesis. However, achieving the simultaneous enhancement of activity, selectivity, and stability in NO 3 RR is still challenging. Herein, taking nickel phosphide as an example, phase engineering (Ni 5 P 4 , Ni 2 P, NiP 2 ) is verified to be an effective approach to concurrently obtain improved activity, selectivity, as well as stability for ammonia synthesis. Among Ni 5 P 4 , Ni 2 P, and NiP 2 , theoretical calculations predict that the Ni 5 P 4 phase possesses better conductivity, optimized H * adsorption energy, lower reaction barrier of the potential‐determining step (NO * to NOH * ), and favorable thermodynamic stability. Inspired by theoretical predictions, the nickel phosphides nanosheets with three phases are successfully synthesized. As expected, the Ni 5 P 4 nanosheets ex","au":["Qi Cao","Weidong Wen","Wanping Sun","Yitong Zhou","Xin‐Yao Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"镍磷化合物的相工程用于同时提高电催化氨合成的活性、选择性和稳定性","zb":"以镍磷化物为例，验证了相工程(Ni5P4, Ni2P, NiP2)可有效同时提高氨合成的活性、选择性和稳定性。理论计算预测Ni5P4相具有更好的导电性、优化的H*吸附能、较低的NO*到NOH*的潜在决定步骤反应势垒和有利的热力学稳定性。实验合成了三种相的镍磷化物纳米片，Ni5P4纳米片在碱性电解质中表现出优于Ni2P纳米片和远高于NiP2纳米片的活性和选择性，在-0.4 V vs. RHE下，硝酸盐转化率为97.4%，NH4+选择性和法拉第效率分别为97.7%和97.6%。Ni5P4纳米片表面轻微氧化为Ni(OH)2，表现出良好的耐久性，in situ生成的Ni(OH)2在氮相关物种的加氢中起重要作用。此外，Ni5P4纳米片在空气等离子体氧化-电催化还原级联系统中也表现出良好性能。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-56l44","t":"Thickness Dependent Flat Band Potentials at the Nanoscale on Hematite Electrodes and an Alternative Fabrication to Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-56l44","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-10-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This work presents a Mott-Schottky analysis on hematite nanolayers (10, 15, 20, and 25 nm) deposited onto fluorine-doped tin oxide-coated glass using atomic layer deposition (ALD) versus physical vapor deposition + annealing (PVD+A) to compare their electrochemical properties. Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy is employed in a limited frequency range to differentiate space charge layer capacitance from electric double layer capacitance. With the ALD films, we present a thickness dependent study and found flat band potentials that increase with thickness at a rate of 13.3 ± 0.6 mV nm-1. The charge carrier density is thickness invariant and in the 1 to 2 x 1019 cm-3 range. The space charge layer thickness, estimated using a range of reported dielectric constants for hematite, appears to match the expected nanolayer thickness with changing the dielectric constant and the thickness does","au":["Franz Geiger","Raiden Speelman","Lauren Martin","Justin Bye","Jacob Kupferberg","Mavis Boamah"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"赤铁矿电极上纳米级平坦带电位的厚度依赖性及原子层沉积的替代制备方法","zb":"使用原子层沉积（ALD）和物理气相沉积+退火（PVD+A）在氟掺杂氧化锡涂层玻璃上沉积 10、15、20 和 25 nm 的赤铁矿纳米层，比较其电化学性质。采用电化学阻抗谱在有限频率范围内区分空间电荷层电容和双电层电容。ALD 薄膜厚度依赖性研究表明平坦带电位随厚度增加，速率为 13.3 ± 0.6 mV nm-1。载流子密度厚度不变，在 1 到 2 x 1019 cm-3 范围内。空间电荷层厚度使用不同赤铁矿介电常数估算，与预期纳米层厚度匹配，改变介电常数时厚度对 pH 值无强依赖。比较 ALD 与 PVD+A 纳米层的物理、光学和电化学性质，表明 PVD+A 是 ALD 的替代方法，当不需要单原子层精度时基于视线。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c06536","t":"The Role of Solid Electrolytes in Suppressing Joule Heating Effect for Scalable H 2 O 2 Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c06536","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The electrosynthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H 2 O 2 ) via oxygen reduction has the potential to revolutionize traditional chemical synthesis. However, this objective is often hindered by the decline in energy efficiency during large-scale production, a guiding metric for the economic feasibility of H 2 O 2 electrosynthesis. This study identifies Joule heating as the primary contributor to efficiency loss as it accelerates H 2 O 2 decomposition and induces substantial voltage drops. Thermal and impedance analyses reveal that Joule heating can be significantly suppressed by enhancing electrolyte conductivity and optimizing reactor structure to reduce internal resistance. Among these strategies, structural optimization shows a bottleneck in reducing internal resistance, while electrolyte conductivity enhancement is the key to further improvement. To balance electrosynthesis performance with ","au":["Congcong Ni","Qi Zhang","Bin Xu","Ning Deng","Xin Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"固体电解质在抑制 H2O2 电合成焦耳热效应中的作用","zb":"针对 H2O2 电合成中焦耳热导致效率下降的问题，本研究通过热分析和阻抗分析发现，增强电解质导电性和优化反应器结构可显著抑制焦耳热。提出一种 Na2SO4-强酸性阳离子交换树脂复合固体电解质，在工业电流密度下实现了高效稳定的 H2O2 生产。","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202504724","t":"Oxidation Dynamics and Surface Chemistry of Iridium and Iridium Oxide Films Grown by Atomic Layer Deposition Using O 2 and O 3","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202504724","s":"Small","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Atomic layer deposition of Ir and IrO 2 is demonstrated using O 2 and O 3 with various exposure conditions as reactants. The nucleation density of Ir increases with the oxidation potential of the reactants, leading to the formation of continuous and conductive films at lower thicknesses. A higher oxidation potential improves the continuity and crystallinity of the Ir films, resulting in a decrease in their resistivity. O 2 ‐based processes result in Ir metal films regardless of O 2 exposure time due to low oxidation potential. Conversely, in O 3 ‐based processes, deposited Ir is oxidized into IrO 2 with prolonged exposure time due to higher oxidation potential of O 3 . The resistivity of IrO 2 films decrease with increasing oxidation potential due to higher purity, resulting from facilitated oxidation. Additionally, the formation of surface OH groups is observed and increased wi","au":["Ji Won Han","Jae Woo Jang","Ryosuke Harada","Woo‐Hee Kim","Ji‐Hoon Ahn","Tae Joo Park"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"使用 O2 和 O3 通过原子层沉积生长的铱和铱氧化物薄膜的氧化动力学和表面化学","zb":"使用 O2 和 O3 及各种暴露条件作为反应物演示了 Ir 和 IrO2 的原子层沉积。Ir 的成核密度随反应物的氧化电势增加，导致在较低厚度下形成连续和导电薄膜。较高的氧化电势提高 Ir 薄膜的连续性和结晶度，降低其电阻率。基于 O2 的工艺由于低氧化电势，无论 O2 暴露时间如何，均形成 Ir 金属薄膜。相反，基于 O3 的工艺由于 O3 较高的氧化电势，沉积的 Ir 随暴露时间氧化成 IrO2。IrO2 薄膜的电阻率随氧化电势增加而降低，由于高纯度，氧化促进。此外，观察到表面 OH 基的形成，并随 O3 暴露时间或压力增加，导致前驱体吸附效率降低，从而抑制薄膜沉积。提出了关于反应物氧化电势和暴露时间的模型，解释 Ir 和 IrO2 薄膜的生长行为。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5605783","t":"Preparation of NixOy/γ-Al2O3 Catalyst and Study on Its Performance in Ammonia Decomposition for Hydrogen Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5605783","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lei Zhang","Yuhang Zhao","Zhang Lei","Ruikang Song","Haocheng Zhao","Kang Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"NixOy/γ-Al2O3 催化剂的制备及其在氨分解制氢性能研究","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5gc04243g","t":"Co–O–Si interface engineering for sustainable ammonia synthesis with nearly 100% faradaic efficiency","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5gc04243g","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Co–O–Si interfacial engineering in hierarchical CoSiO x nanoflowers with abundant oxygen vacancies enables nearly 100% faradaic efficiency for selective eight-electron nitrate-to-ammonia conversion under ambient conditions.","au":["Weize Chen","Hui Su","Xuan Zheng","Xiaoping Chen","Jing Tang","Yi Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Co-O-Si 界面工程用于可持续氨合成，法拉第效率接近 100%","zb":"在分级 CoSiO x 纳米花中 Co-O-Si 界面工程和丰富的氧空位使在环境条件下选择性八电子硝酸到氨的转化法拉第效率接近 100%。"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202508056","t":"In Situ Exsolved FeRu Nanoparticles‐Enhanced Biomimetic Electrode for Intermediate Temperature Ammonia Synthesis and Simulation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202508056","s":"Small","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is an important fundamental chemical feedstock and hydrogen carrier. The conventional routes of ammonia synthesis via Haber‒Bosch process suffer from high energy consumption and substantial carbon emissions, highlighting the urgent need for an alternative technology under moderate conditions that is both efficient and sustainable. Here, the electrochemical synthesis of NH 3 is demonstrated and simulated using a biomimetic electrode in a protonic ceramic electrochemical cell (PCEC). Inspired by active center structure of nitrogenase, FeMo‐based electrodes are rationally designed and integrated with in situ exsolved FeRu nanoparticles, leading to significantly enhanced N 2 activation and reduction kinetics. At 500 °C and 0.2 V, the electrode exhibits an excellent NH 3 synthesis rate of 4.06 × 10 −10 mol s −1 cm −2 and remains relatively stable over 100 h. Simulations indic","au":["Yakun Wang","Long Wang","Yeqing Ling","Duanhao Wang","Guangming Yang","Tao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"原位解吸 FeRu 纳米颗粒增强的仿生电极用于中间温度氨合成和模拟","zb":"氨是一种重要的基础化学原料和氢载体。传统的通过哈伯-博施工艺合成氨的路线存在高能耗和大量碳排放问题，迫切需要一种在温和条件下高效和可持续的替代技术。在这里，使用仿生电极在质子陶瓷电化学电池（PCEC）中展示了氨的电化学合成和模拟。受氮酶活性中心结构的启发，合理设计和集成了原位解吸的 FeRu 纳米颗粒的 FeMo 基电极，显著增强了 N2 活化和还原动力学。在 500 °C 和 0.2 V 下，电极表现出 4.06 × 10 −10 mol s −1 cm −2 的优异 NH 3 合成速率，并在 100 小时内保持相对稳定。模拟表明，在高压下升高温度而不是竞争性的析氢反应（HER）可能会抑制 NH 3 合成。这项工作结合了实验结果和多物理场模拟，为高效的 NH 3 生产提供了一种有前景的策略，并扩展了 PCEC 的催化应用。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202501785","t":"Potential‐ and Time‐Dependent Operando X‐Ray Absorption Study of Cu 2 O Microcrystals Transformations during Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202501785","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2025-10-14","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) represents a sustainable, carbon‐neutral alternative to the Haber–Bosch process for ammonia synthesis. Time‐resolved operando X‐ray absorption spectroscopy reveals the chemical states and structural evolution of copper(I) oxide microcrystals deposited on carbon fiber (Cu 2 O/C) across a potential range of +0.6 to −0.7 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode (V RHE ), where nitrate reduction to nitrite and ammonia occurs. Without nitrate, Cu 2 O microcrystals are quickly reduced to metallic Cu(0) aggregates at low reduction potentials (≈0.1 V RHE ). In contrast, only 29% Cu(0) is observed in 0.1 M NaNO 3 at 0.1 V RHE , indicating that nitrate adsorption passivates the surface and promotes selective electron transfer to nitrate, thereby retarding the kinetics of Cu 2 O microcrystals transformation to Cu(0) particles. Ammonia formation ini","au":["Rizki Marcony Surya","Surya Pratap Singh","Kosuke Beppu","Fumiaki Amano"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"硝酸还原反应过程中 Cu2O 微晶转化的潜在和时间依赖的原位 X 射线吸收研究","zb":"电化学硝酸还原反应（NO3RR）代表了一种可持续、碳中性的哈伯-博施工艺替代方法用于氨合成。时间分辨原位 X 射线吸收光谱揭示了沉积在碳纤维上的 Cu2O/C 上的铜(I)氧化物微晶在相对于可逆氢电极（V RHE ）+0.6 至 −0.7 V 的电势范围内的化学状态和结构演变，其中发生硝酸还原成亚硝酸和氨。在没有硝酸盐的情况下，Cu2O 微晶在低还原电势（≈0.1 V RHE ）下迅速还原成金属 Cu(0) 聚集物。相比之下，在 0.1 M NaNO3 中，0.1 V RHE 下只观察到 29% 的 Cu(0)，表明硝酸盐吸附钝化了表面并促进对硝酸盐的选择性电子转移，从而延缓了 Cu2O 微晶转化为 Cu(0) 颗粒的动力学。氨的形成在 0.1 M NaNO3 (pH 13) 溶液中始于 −0.3 V RHE，伴随着金属铜颗粒的形成用于中间体的氢化。氨的法拉第效率（FE）随着更负的电势而增","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.20944/preprints202510.0817.v1","t":"Use of a 3D Workpiece to Inductively Heat an Ammonia Cracking Reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.20944/preprints202510.0817.v1","s":"Preprints.org","d":"2025-10-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ammonia, widely regarded as the &quot;hydrogen carrier of the future,&quot; offers high hydrogen content, ease of production, and a well-established infrastructure for handling and transportation on a global scale. Meanwhile, ammonia cracking requires heat supply at high temperatures and induction heating provides efficient, precise, and rapid heating to conductive materials of different shapes and sizes. Therefore, this work presents a proof of concept for ammonia cracking using induction heating with 3 different reactor configurations: (1) a 3D metal workpiece; (2) a 3D metal workpiece and Ni/Al2O3 catalyst; and (3) only Ni/Al2O3 catalyst. The performance of the inductively heated reactor is also compared to the one using an electric furnace. The results showed that the reactor configuration containing both the workpiece and the catalyst was the most efficient in terms of electric powe","au":["Débora de Figueiredo Luiz","Martien Koppes","Marija Saric","Jurriaan Boon"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Cracking","rapid heating"],"zt":"使用三维工件感应加热氨裂解反应器","zb":"氨作为未来的氢载体，具有高氢含量、易于生产和全球范围内成熟的处理和运输基础设施。氨裂解需要在高温下供热，感应加热为不同形状和大小的导电器材提供高效、精确和快速的加热。本研究展示了使用感应加热进行氨裂解的概念验证，使用了三种不同的反应器配置：(1) 三维金属工件；(2) 三维金属工件和 Ni/Al2O3 催化剂；(3) 仅 Ni/Al2O3 催化剂。结果表明，包含工件和催化剂的反应器配置在快速达到高温方面电力使用效率最高；仅含催化剂的配置效率最低。工件表面在运行后只有轻微的结构变化，系统性能未受影响。三维工件的使用允许反应器内快速和均匀的转化和加热，在应用感应加热到化学反应器时实现高效和动态的过程控制。","ob":"氨分解制氢","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5cp02945g","t":"Finding the temperature window for atomic layer deposition of ruthenium metal via efficient phonon calculations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cp02945g","s":"Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics","d":"2025-10-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Reproduce and rationalize the experimental observation that ALD of Ru metal from RuO 4 and H 2 occurs only in a narrow temperature window above 100 °C based on free energies from highly-scalable cloud-ready phonon calculations at the DFT level.","au":["Alexandr Fonari","Simon D. Elliott","Casey N. Brock","Yan Li","Jacob Gavartin","Mathew D. Halls"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过高效的声子计算寻找钌金属原子层沉积的温度窗口","zb":"基于 DFT 级别的高可扩展云就绪声子计算的自由能，复现并合理解释了从 RuO4 和 H2 沉积钌金属仅在 100°C 以上的窄温度窗口发生的实验观察。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1007/s11998-025-01154-z","t":"Emerging applications and trends in atomic layer deposition nano-coatings","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11998-025-01154-z","s":"Journal of Coatings Technology and Research","d":"2025-10-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Nano-coating with atomic layer deposition (ALD) has emerged as a pivotal technology for enhancing the performance of a wide range of applications. This review explores recent advancements in ALD nano-coating, with a focus on its high conformality and precision. The review covers key coating techniques and comprehensive methods for analytical coating assessment. The applications discussed include multifunctional coatings, biomedical devices, quantum dot-based technologies, photovoltaic solar cells, energy storage systems, membrane/barrier films, metal–organic frameworks, graphene integration, and sensor technologies. Additionally, the review highlights emerging trends, current applications, and identifies various research gaps, offering insights into potential future directions for ALD nano-coating. The findings underscore ALD’s significant impact in advancing both scientific and","au":["Emmanuel O. Atofarati","Peter O. Oviroh","Oladipo Folorunso","Tien Chien Jen"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积纳米涂层的Emerging 应用和趋势","zb":"纳米涂层原子层沉积（ALD）已成为提高广泛应用性能的关键技术。本综述探讨了 ALD 纳米涂层的最新进展，重点关注其高共形性和精度。涵盖了关键涂层技术和全面的涂层分析评估方法。讨论的应用包括多功能涂层、生物医学设备、基于量子点的技术、光伏太阳能电池、储能系统、膜/屏障薄膜、金属有机框架、石墨烯集成和传感器技术。此外，综述强调了新兴趋势、当前应用并确定了各种研究差距，为 ALD 纳米涂层未来的潜在方向提供了见解。研究结果突出了 ALD 在推进科学和工业应用方面的重大影响，同时强调了持续创新以应对现有挑战的必要性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202501807","t":"Conjugated Coordination Polymer Catalysts for Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202501807","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2025-10-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrosynthesis of ammonia (NH 3 ) with renewable energy sources offers a highly promising alternative for sustainable NH 3 production under mild conditions. Among the reported NH 3 synthesis catalysts, single‐atom catalysts display high activity, selectivity, and stability toward NH 3 synthesis reactions owing to their well‐defined catalytic sites and maximum metal‐atom utilization. Conjugated coordination polymers (CCPs) with single‐atom active sites and precisely controlled coordination environment hold significant potential in electrochemical NH 3 synthesis. Abundant advances have been recently made toward the development of CCPs for NH 3 synthesis at ambient conditions. This review specifically discusses several strategies of CCPs modification and their applications in the synthesis of NH 3 . Finally, the existing challenges are discussed and perspectives on future developments are","au":["Shouhan Zhang","Li Qing","Jiaxin Zhang","Ziwei Ma","Shuting Zhan","Longsheng Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"共轭配位聚合物催化剂用于氨电合成","zb":"使用可再生能源来源的电合成氨（NH 3 ）为温和条件下可持续 NH 3 生产提供了一种极具前景的替代方法。在报道的 NH 3 合成催化剂中，单原子催化剂由于其定义明确的催化位点和最大金属原子利用率，对 NH 3 合成反应表现出高活性、选择性和稳定性。具有单原子活性位点和精确控制配位环境的共轭配位聚合物（CCP）在环境条件下合成 NH 3 方面具有巨大潜力。最近在开发用于环境条件下合成 NH 3 的 CCP 方面取得了大量进展。本综述特别讨论了 CCP 修饰的几种策略及其在 NH 3 合成中的应用。最后，讨论了现有挑战并对未来发展方向进行了展望。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.59717/j.xinn-energy.2025.100122","t":"Progress of metal hydrides, amides and imides for ammonia synthesis and decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.59717/j.xinn-energy.2025.100122","s":"The Innovation Energy","d":"2025-10-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":17,"ab":"<p>Ammonia, as a key feedstock for nitrogen fertilizers, also plays a crucial role as an energy and hydrogen carrier in the storage and conversion of renewable energy. The synthesis and decomposition of ammonia are central to realizing its full potential in these applications. Recent studies have highlighted the versatile chemical interconversions of alkali/alkaline metal hydrides, amides, and imides exhibit with N<sub>2<\/sub>, H<sub>2<\/sub>, or NH<sub>3<\/sub>. Building on these findings, a series of highly efficient catalysts and novel processes for ammonia synthesis and ammonia decomposition have been developed. This review comprehensively summarizes recent progress in utilizing these compounds as functional materials for catalytic and chemical looping processes in ammonia synthesis and decomposition. Special attention is given to the unique roles of hydrides, amides, and imides in act","au":["Sheng Feng","Wenbo Gao","Jianping Guo","Ping Chen"],"o":"回填","w":["Ping Chen"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"金属氢化物、酰胺和亚胺在氨合成与分解方面的进展","zb":"氨作为氮肥的关键原料，在可再生能源的储存和转换中作为能量和氢载体也发挥着关键作用。氨的合成与分解是实现其在这些应用中全部潜力的核心。近期研究强调了碱金属/碱土金属氢化物、酰胺和亚胺与 N2、H2 或 NH3 的多功能化学互转化。基于这些发现，开发了一系列高效的催化剂和新型氨合成与氨分解工艺。本综述全面总结了利用这些化合物作为催化和化学链工艺中功能材料在氨合成与分解方面的最新进展。特别关注了氢化物、酰胺和亚胺在活化与转化 N2 和 NH3 中的独特作用、它们的反应机制，并讨论了这些材料在氨合成与分解过程中的当前挑战和未来前景。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c13688","t":"Boosting the Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction Reaction Activity on Two-Dimensional Conductive Metal–Organic Frameworks: A Theoretical Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c13688","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-10-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is a promising alternative to the traditional Haber-Bosch process to generate ammonia (NH3). Exploring NRR electrocatalysts with efficient performance and stability is crucial for NH3 production. In this work, on the basis of density functional theory (DFT) calculations, we systematically studied various TMO4-HTP and TMN4-HTP (TM refers to V, Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, Ni, Nb, Mo, Ru, Rh, Pd, Ta, W, Re, Os, Ir, and Pt; HTP refers to hexatriphenylene) of conductive two-dimensional (2D) metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) as potential electrocatalysts for the NRR. The strong interaction between TM atoms and the O4-HTP/N4-HTP substrates could guarantee the thermodynamic and electrochemical stabilities of the designed TMO4-HTP and TMN4-HTP. The calculated results suggest that ReO4-HTP, MoO4-HTP, and MoN4-HTP could serve as promising electrocatalysts. Moreo","au":["Xiaoping Gao","Yanan Zhou","Wenhua Zhang","Jinlong Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"二维导电金属有机框架：理论研究中提高电催化氮还原反应活性的研究","zb":"电催化氮还原反应（NRR）是传统哈伯-博施工艺生成氨（NH3）的一种有前景的替代方法。探索具有高效性能和稳定性的 NRR 电催化剂对于 NH3 生产至关重要。在这项工作中，基于密度泛函理论（DFT）计算，系统地研究了各种 TMO4-HTP 和 TMN4-HTP（TM 指的是 V、Cr、Mn、Fe、Co、Ni、Nb、Mo、Ru、Rh、Pd、Ta、W、Re、Os、Ir 和 Pt；HTP 指的是六苯并三苯）导电二维（2D）金属有机框架（MOFs）作为 NRR 潜在电催化剂。TM 原子和 O4-HTP/N4-HTP 基底的强相互作用可以保证设计的 TMO4-HTP 和 TMN4-HTP 的热力学和电化学稳定性。计算结果表明 ReO4-HTP、MoO4-HTP 和 MoN4-HTP 可以作为有前景的电催化剂。此外，ReO4-HTP 具有最高的活性，计算极限电势值为 -0.34 V。值得注意的是，Re","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1360/ssc-2025-0192","t":"Precise construction of multicomponent catalysts by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1360/ssc-2025-0192","s":"SCIENTIA SINICA Chimica","d":"2025-10-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"多组分催化剂的精准构建是多相催化研究的重点. 然而, 由于传统方法制备的催化剂粒子均一性有待提高, 各组分位置随机, 结构不明确, 制约了催化剂的结构优化与性能提升. 针对这些关键问题, 作者开展了将原子层沉积(ALD)技术应用于多组分催化剂精准构建的特色研究工作, 提出了组分空间分布精准调控及协同机制研究的新思路. 发展了利用ALD精细调变催化剂粒子尺寸、界面结构的方法, 调控组分空间分布, 实现了界面微结构、微环境等的精准调控. 构建结构明确的空间分离催化剂, 揭示了反应物种迁移扩散规律, 阐明溢流/反溢流促进的协同机制, 提出利用可控溢流调控活性粒子电子状态的新策略. 以上研究工作对于在原子/分子层次理解催化剂构效关系及协同催化机制, 以及设计开发新型高效多组分催化剂提供了指导.","au":["Jing Luo","Xiaohan Wang","Zhe Gao"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积精确构建多组分催化剂","zb":"针对传统方法制备的催化剂组分分布随机、结构不明确的问题，作者利用原子层沉积技术实现了组分空间分布的精准调控。通过精细调变催化剂粒子尺寸和界面结构，构建了结构明确的空间分离催化剂，揭示了溢流/反溢流促进的协同机制。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202516964","t":"Spatial Decoupling of Adsorption and Transformation Sites on Ag‐Cu Dual‐Single‐Atom Catalysts for Highly Selective Photocatalytic Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202516964","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-10-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Photocatalytic nitrate (NO 3 – ) reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ) presents a sustainable solution for simultaneous NH 3 synthesis and wastewater remediation. However, achieving high selectivity is challenging, plagued by sluggish kinetics and parasitic side reactions. In this study, we rationally design a synergistic Ag‐Cu dual‐atom catalyst on g‐C 3 N 4 (AgCu‐CN) that embodies a spatially decoupled tandem scheme. We demonstrate that the oxophilic Cu 1 site serve as Lewis acid centers to efficiently capture and activate NO 3 – , before the crucial *NO intermediate is shuttled to adjacent Ag 1 site, which is intrinsically inert toward the hydrogen evolution reaction, act as dedicated hydrogenation center for rapid and deep *NO reduction. This atomic‐level synergy manifests in a state‐of‐the‐art performance, with AgCu‐CN delivering an impressive 98% NH 3 selectivity and a production r","au":["Zichao Lian","Di Luo","Jiarui Yang","Yupeng Yang","Shengzhi Tang","Hao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"Ag-Cu双单原子催化剂上吸附和转化位点的空间解耦用于高选择性光催化硝酸盐至氨还原","zb":"光催化硝酸盐 (NO3–) 还原为氨 (NH3) 为同时氨合成和废水处理提供了一种可持续的解决方案。然而，实现高选择性具有挑战性，受限于缓慢的动力学和副反应。本研究合理设计了一种在 g-C3N4 上的 Ag-Cu双原子催化剂 (AgCu-CN)，体现了空间解耦的串联方案。研究表明，亲氧的 Cu1 位点是路易斯酸位点，可有效捕获和活化 NO3–，然后关键的 *NO 中间体被转移到相邻的 Ag1 位点，该位点对析氢反应本质上惰性，作为 *NO 还原的专用加氢中心。这种原子级协同作用体现在最先进的性能中，AgCu-CN 在可见光下提供 98% 的 NH3 选择性和 630.5 µmol h −1 g −1 的产率。原位光谱研究和理论计算证实了串联机制和 Ag-Cu 双位点在引导反应选择性中的关键作用。本研究建立了一种强大的串联催化设计原则，以管理复杂多质子/电子反应中的选择性挑战。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c03815","t":"Minireview on Perovskite Oxide-Based Materials toward Enhanced Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction for Ammonia Synthesis: Advances and Perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c03815","s":"Energy & Fuels","d":"2025-10-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is not only an essential chemical for industry and agriculture but also a promising energy carrier due to its high energy density, carbon-free nature, and ease of storage. However, its conventional production via the Haber–Bosch process is energy-intensive and emits significant greenhouse gases. Recently, electrochemical nitrate reduction has emerged as a sustainable alternative, enabling the conversion of nitrate pollutants from wastewater into valuable ammonia under ambient conditions by using renewable electricity. Among various catalyst candidates, perovskite oxides have attracted increasing attention due to their compositional flexibility, structural tunability, and favorable electronic properties. This review provides a timely overview of recent advances in perovskite oxide-based catalysts for the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction toward ammonia synthesis (eNO 3 RR","au":["Xiaomin Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于钙钛矿氧化物材料增强电催化硝酸盐还原用于氨合成：进展与展望","zb":"氨不仅是一种重要的工业和农业化学品，而且由于其高能量密度、无碳性质和易于储存，是一种有前景的能源载体。然而，传统的哈伯-博施 (H–B) 工艺生产氨是高能耗的，并排放大量的温室气体。最近，电化学硝酸盐还原已成为一种可持续的替代方案，利用可再生电力在环境条件下将废水中的硝酸盐污染物转化为有价值的氨。在各种催化剂候选者中，钙钛矿氧化物由于其成分灵活性、结构可调性和有利的电子性质而受到越来越多的关注。本综述及时概述了基于钙钛矿氧化物催化剂用于电化学硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3RR）合成氨（eNO3RR）的最新进展。我们首先概述了 eNO3RR 的反应机制，并讨论了钙钛矿氧化物对于 eNO3RR 的独特优势。然后，我们批判性地检查了提高电催化性能的关键设计策略。最后，我们探讨了推进基于钙钛矿的 eNO3RR 系统的未来方向，重点关注标准化基准测试、机理阐明和器件开发。本综述旨在为在电催化、环境修复和可","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202501232","t":"Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis: Catalysts Design Strategies, Progress, and Prospects","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202501232","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2025-10-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ), recognized as a prospective green energy carrier due to its high hydrogen density and ease of transport, has garnered significant attention. However, the conventional Haber–Bosch (H–B) process for ammonia synthesis necessitates high‐temperature and high‐pressure conditions, accompanied by substantial carbon dioxide emissions. Consequently, the development of novel green ammonia synthesis technologies has become a focal point of research. Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis, leveraging solar energy as the driving force, converts nitrogen to ammonia under ambient conditions, offering advantages such as low energy consumption and environmental friendliness. This review summarizes recent advancements in photocatalytic ammonia synthesis, emphasizing nitrogen activation mechanisms, photocatalytic reaction pathways, and the design and optimization strategies for various p","au":["Fei‐Yang Tian","Rui‐Xue Cheng","Yu‐Qing Qiu","Le Pan","Qi‐Ming She","Xue‐Kai Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"光催化氨合成：催化剂设计策略、进展与前景","zb":"氨 (NH3)，由于其高氢密度和易于运输，被认为是一种有前景的绿色能源载体，已引起广泛关注。然而，传统的哈伯-博施 (H–B) 氨合成工艺需要在高温高压条件下进行，并伴有大量的二氧化碳排放。因此，开发新型绿色氨合成技术已成为研究的热点。光催化氨合成利用太阳能作为驱动力，在环境条件下将氮转化为氨，具有低能耗和环保等优点。本综述总结了光催化氨合成的最新进展，强调了氮活化机制、光催化反应路径以及各种光催化剂的设计和优化策略。通过详细分析生物模拟催化剂、Ti 基材料、Bi 基材料、金属有机框架 (MOFs) 材料、石墨相氮化碳 (g-C3N4) 材料和 MXene 材料，讨论了它们在光催化氨合成中的应用和局限性。此外，本文综合了光催化剂设计策略，包括形貌控制、空位工程和带隙工程，旨在为未来新型光催化剂的设计提供理论支持和实践指导。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c04632","t":"Stable Electrothermal Reforming of Undiluted CH 4 /CO 2 by Integrating Encapsulated Ni Nanoparticles with Internal Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c04632","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-10-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Methane dry reforming (DRM) serves as a promising solution for mitigating carbon emission by valorizing two greenhouse gases (GHGs), methane and carbon dioxide, into value added syngas. However, the industrialization of DRM is practically hindered by extreme energy consumption, rapid coke formation, and severe metal sintering. All three limitations rooted in the high operation temperature required for overcoming the strong reaction endothermicity (Δ H = 247 kJ/mol). Herein, we presented an approach to address these bottlenecks via a highly efficient and stable electrothermal DRM (EDRM) process employing solely electricity-induced heat (Joule heating) as the heat source and adopting highly active structured Ni-embedded zeolite as catalysts. Using undiluted mixture of CH 4 and CO 2 as feedstock, EDRM exhibited superior space-time yield of syngas (17850 L syngas /(g Ni h)) that surpassed th","au":["Xiaoqiang Huang","Jingwen Chu","Yanru Zhu","Jingrou Ye","Chengeng Li","Jing He"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过集成封装的 Ni 纳米颗粒与内部焦耳加热实现无稀释 CH4/CO2 的稳定电热重整","zb":"为解决甲烷干重整中高温导致的结焦和金属烧结问题，本研究采用电热重整工艺，利用焦耳加热作为热源。在 800 °C 下连续运行 330 小时，未稀释 CH4/CO2 混合物表现出 17850 L/g Ni h 的时空产率，且无明显失活或结焦。","ob":"甲烷干重整｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5lc00772k","t":"High-throughput nanoparticle manipulation via controlled electro-elasticity and Joule heating in microchannels","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5lc00772k","s":"Lab on a Chip","d":"2025-10-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"High-throughput nanoparticle manipulation is achieved in microchannels via controlled electro-elasticity, while Joule heating is mitigated through a straightforward cooling strategy to enable operation under high electric fields.","au":["Xinlei Qi","Shuhao Ma","Guoqing Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过微通道中的可控电弹性与焦耳加热实现高通量纳米颗粒操控","zb":"在微通道中通过可控电弹性实现高通量纳米颗粒操控，通过简单的冷却策略减轻焦耳加热，以在高电场下运行。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-7765405/v1","t":"Nitrogen Allotrope N6 Enables Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis under Anodic Polarization","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-7765405/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2025-10-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis using N 2 as reactant is hampered by the low Faradaic efficiency due to the competing hydrogen evolution reaction under cathodic potential conditions. This limitation can be overcome by exchanging N 2 for the nitrogen allotrope N 6 , which shifts the equilibrium potential for electrocatalytic ammonia formation by several hundred millivolts toward anodic conditions. Here we exemplify the electrochemical N 6 reduction to ammonia using single-atom centers of molybdenum-based MXenes as a model electrocatalyst. Using a combination of different in silico methods, we demonstrate that electrocatalytic ammonia formation under positive bias is possible without concomitant hydrogen evolution. The application of allotropes for nitrogen conversion opens new avenues for the targeted synthesis of basic chemicals in electrochemical systems through the efficien","au":["Kai S. Exner","Diwakar Singh","Ebrahim Tayyebi"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"氮同素异形体N6实现阳极极化下的电催化氨合成","zb":"使用 N2 作为反应物的电催化氨合成受阴极电位条件下竞争的析氢反应导致法拉第效率低下的限制。这一限制可以通过用氮同素异形体 N6 代替 N2 来克服，该同素异形体将电催化氨形成的平衡电位向阳极条件移动数百毫伏。在这里，我们使用基于钼的 MXenes 的单原子中心作为模型电催化剂，举例说明了电化学 N6 还原为氨。通过结合不同的计算机模拟方法，我们证明了在正偏置下进行电催化氨形成是可能的，而不会伴随析氢。将同素异形体用于氮转化为新途径，通过有效利用绿色电子和质子，在电化学系统中靶向合成基本化学品。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/adem.202501627","t":"LiVO 3 /LiZnVO 4 Nanocomposite: High Performance Electrocatalyst for Ambient Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adem.202501627","s":"Advanced Engineering Materials","d":"2025-10-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (e‐NRR) has emerged as a sustainable alternative to the energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch process for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. Lithium‐based electrocatalysts are particularly promising due to the high thermodynamic affinity of lithium toward nitrogen, which facilitates spontaneous N 2 adsorption to lower the activation energy required for dinitrogen dissociation. By promoting proton‐coupled electron transfer and stabilizing NRR intermediates, the composite catalyst enhances reaction kinetics, enabling efficient NH 3 production. While nonaqueous lithium‐containing electrolytes suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction, lithium deposition from electrolyte decomposition inhibits e‐NRR. This study addresses the challenge by structurally integrating lithium into a LiVO 3 /LiZnVO 4 nanocomposite, which channels lithium into active catalytic sites ra","au":["Naina Goyal","Dhamotharan Dharmasigamani","Fabio Pires","Ravi Kumar","Sanjay Mathur"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"LiVO3/LiZnVO4纳米复合材料：用于环境条件下氮还原为氨的高性能电催化剂","zb":"电催化氮还原反应 (e‐NRR) 已成为哈伯-博施工艺的可持续替代方案，用于氨 (NH3) 合成。由于锂对氮的高热力学亲和力，锂基电催化剂特别有前景，这促进了氮的吸附以降低二氮分解所需的活化能。通过促进质子偶联电子转移和稳定 NRR 中间体，复合材料催化剂增强了反应动力学，实现了高效的 NH3 生产。虽然非水含锂电解质抑制了析氢反应，但电解质分解的锂沉积抑制了 e‐NRR。本研究通过将锂结构集成到 LiVO3/LiZnVO4 纳米复合材料中解决了这一挑战，该复合材料将锂引导到活性催化位点而不是寄生沉积。氧化物-氧化物纳米复合材料电催化剂在相对于可逆氢电极的 -0.5 V 下在 0.1 M HCl 电解液中提供 53.7 μg h −1 mg cat −1 的氨产率和 44.8% 的法拉第效率 (FE)。据我们所知，本报告报告了与其他报道的锂介导系统相比 FE 的显著提高，并与过渡金属基催化","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5se01158b","t":"Ultrafast synthesis of NiCo alloy catalysts by Joule heating for the electrocatalytic hydrogen evolution reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5se01158b","s":"Sustainable Energy & Fuels","d":"2025-10-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ultrafast Joule heating successfully produced small, well-dispersed NiCo alloy nanoparticles. The obtained catalyst shows markedly higher hydrogen evolution reaction activity than those synthesized by traditional heating.","au":["Wence Ma","Zhiyuan Niu","Haidong Wang","Jinlong Li","Kaixin Zhu","Weiguang Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热快速合成 NiCo 合金催化剂用于电催化析氢反应","zb":"焦耳热成功制备了小尺寸、分散良好的 NiCo 合金纳米颗粒。所得催化剂在析氢反应中的活性明显高于传统加热方法合成的催化剂。","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5nr03230j","t":"Joule-thermal synthesis of graphitic carbon-encapsulated Fe/Fe 3 N/FeN catalysts for efficient peroxymonosulfate activation toward quinoline degradation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5nr03230j","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2025-10-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"A graphitic carbon-encapsulated Fe/Fe 3 N/FeN catalyst was synthesized using a carbon-assisted flash Joule heating method. The catalyst was specifically engineered to activate peroxymonosulfate (PMS) for effective quinoline degradation.","au":["Longhuan Dai","Xinlong Yan","Rui Feng","Tianbo Li","Feifei Yang","Xiaoyan Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热合成石墨碳包覆的 Fe/Fe3N/FeN 催化剂用于高效过一硫酸盐活化降解喹啉","zb":"使用碳辅助闪焦耳加热法合成了一种石墨碳包覆的 Fe/Fe3N/FeN 催化剂。该催化剂被专门设计用于活化过一硫酸盐 (PMS) 以有效降解喹啉。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1039/d5nr03458b","t":"π–π electron conjugation-assisted synthesis of a robust heterostructured CoO–MoO 2 catalyst: accelerated ammonia borane hydrolysis for hydrogen evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5nr03458b","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2025-10-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Heterostructured multicomponent catalysts can be developed to exploit their unique interfacial effects for enhancing their catalytic activities by optimizing their electronic structures.","au":["Junrui Zhang","Nuo Lei","Yunqi Jia","Shengrong Guo","Liuzhang Ouyang","Xuezhang Xiao"],"o":"回填","zt":"利用 π-π 电子共轭辅助合成一种鲁棒的 CoO–MoO2 催化剂：加速氨硼烷水解制氢","zb":"研究对象为 CoO–MoO2 催化剂，关键方法为利用 π-π 电子共轭辅助合成，主要结果为该催化剂能加速氨硼烷水解制氢。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cs00969c","t":"Efficient green synthesis of ammonia: from mechanistic understanding to reactor design for potential production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cs00969c","s":"Chemical Society Reviews","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"This review summarizes recent advances in green ammonia synthesis technologies. It systematically evaluates catalyst design for converting diverse nitrogen sources, structure–performance relationships and advanced reactor engineering.","au":["Zhenhui Kou","Dong Shi","Bin Yang","Zhongjian Li","Qinghua Zhang","Jianguo Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"高效绿色合成氨：从机理理解到反应器设计","zb":"综述总结了绿色氨合成技术的最新进展，系统评估了将不同氮源转化为氨的催化剂设计、构效关系以及先进的反应器工程。","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5cy00707k","t":"Induction heating applied to anisole HDO using formic acid as a hydrogen source","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cy00707k","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Magnetically induced heating catalysis using encapsulated magnetic nanoparticles as heating agents presents itself as a new efficient method for carrying out high-temperature reactions.","au":["Verónica Naharro-Ovejero","Mónica Dhanjani","Gorka Salas","Ana Belén Dongil"],"o":"回填","why":["Induction heating"],"zt":"感应加热应用于茴香醇选择性氧化使用甲酸作为氢源","zb":"使用封装的磁性纳米颗粒作为加热剂进行磁感应加热催化，是一种进行高温反应的新高效方法。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c06041","t":"Plasma-Assisted Ammonia Synthesis from N 2 and H 2 O over rGO-TiO 2 Catalysts: Enhancing Energy Efficiency and Unraveling Reaction Mechanisms","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c06041","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The reduction of N 2 to ammonia (NH 3 ) using H 2 O as a hydrogen source is a promising low-carbon alternative to the Haber–Bosch process, but the efficient dissociation of N 2 and H 2 O remains a challenge. Here, a reduced graphene oxide–titanium dioxide (rGO-TiO 2 ) hybrid catalyst was developed to enhance H 2 O and N 2 dissociation under dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) plasma, facilitating plasma-assisted ammonia synthesis. The 5-rGO-TiO 2 catalyst achieved an NH 3 formation rate of 4196.62 μmol g cat –1 h –1 and a high energy efficiency of 1317.77 mg kWh –1 . Mechanistic investigations using optical emission spectroscopy (OES), in situ Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR), and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) confirmed the formation of reactive nitrogen species, NH x intermediates, and NH 3, demonstrating the synergistic role of rGO in electron transfer and reactan","au":["Shilin Song","Fei Wang","Xin Sun","Yi Chen","Jiawen Liu","Yanxing Shi"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体辅助的 rGO-TiO 2 催化剂上从 N 2 和 H 2 O 合成氨：提高能量效率和解反应机理","zb":"研究对象为 rGO-TiO 2 催化剂，关键方法为在介电屏障放电 (DBD) 等离子体下合成氨，主要结果为 5-rGO-TiO 2 催化剂实现了 4196.62 μmol g cat –1 h –1 的氨形成速率和 1317.77 mg kWh –1 的高能量效率。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及碳材料｜等离子体驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202513320","t":"Low‐Voltage Driven Co‐Production of Ammonia, Formate, and Hydrogen From Nitrite Reduction Coupled Formaldehyde Oxidation System on Ultra‐Stable AuCuRh Nanowires under Illumination","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202513320","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The nitrite electroreduction reaction (NO 2 RR) offers a green and sustainable pathway for environmental wastewater treatment and ammonia (NH 3 ) generation. Herein, defect‐rich trimetallic AuCuRh nanowires (AuCuRh NWs) with a large number of grain boundaries, twin boundaries, and atomic steps are successfully synthesized by galvanic replacement reaction. Due to its self‐stability and high activity, AuCuRh NWs can efficiently drive the stable NO 2 RR at 0 V potential (Faradaic efficiency: 98.32%, NH 3 yield rate: 20.49 mg h −1 mg cat −1 ). Moreover, AuCuRh NWs also reveal excellent electrocatalytic activity for the formaldehyde electrooxidation reaction (FOR), which can reach 10 mA cm −2 at only 0.35 V potential. The NO 2 RR||FOR electrolysis system assembled with AuCuRh NWs requires only the electrolysis voltage of 0.38 V to achieve the co‐production of NH 3 , formate, and hydr","au":["Ze‐Nong Zhang","Xiao‐Hui Wang","Wei Zhong","Xuan Ai","Xin Wang","Shu‐Ni Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrite Reduction"],"zt":"低电压驱动下在光照下 AuCuRh 纳米线上的亚硝酸盐还原联甲醛氧化体系协同制备氨、甲酸盐和氢","zb":"研究对象为 AuCuRh 纳米线，关键方法为电化学还原亚硝酸盐和甲醛氧化，主要结果为在 0 V 电压下亚硝酸盐还原的 Faradaic 效率为 98.32%，氨产率率为 20.49 mg h −1 mg cat −1，体系在 0.38 V 电压下稳定连续电解 300 小时。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5576910","t":"Rational design of Cu-based dual-atom alloy catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia: First-principles calculations","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5576910","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yufei Wang","Jiahang Li","Donghai Wu","Yanwei Luo","Dongwei Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"基于 Cu 的新型双原子合金催化剂用于电催化氮还原为氨：第一性原理计算","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5gc04101e","t":"Coordination regulation of single-atom catalysts toward enhanced photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5gc04101e","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review systematically summarizes recent advances in single-atom regulation for enhanced photocatalytic ammonia synthesis, focusing on structure–property relationships.","au":["Rong Tang","Hu Guo","Wei Jiang","Jun Di"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"配位调控单原子催化剂以增强光催化氨合成","zb":"综述系统总结了配位调控单原子催化剂以增强光催化氨合成的最新进展，重点关注结构-性能关系。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c13804","t":"Paired Electrocatalysis: Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Coupled with Anodic Upcycling of Biomass and Plastic Waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c13804","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalysis is pivotal for sustainable energy conversion and the efficient production of value-added chemicals and fuels. The development of innovative and cost-effective electrocatalytic technologies is critical to addressing global energy and environmental challenges. However, conventional electrocatalytic systems often suffer from low energy efficiency (EE) as they utilize only one-half-cell reaction while the counter half-reaction is neglected, leading to increased operational costs. Paired electrocatalysis offers a synergistic strategy by coupling two value-generating complementary half-cell reactions within a single electrolytic system. This approach reduces the cell voltage, enhances EE, and improves the economic viability of the process by enabling the simultaneous production of valuable products with higher yields and faster reaction kinetics. This review highlights recent ","au":["Loknath Thapa","Sudip Mallobarman","C. Retna Raj"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"配对电催化：硝酸盐还原为氨与阳极升级生物质和塑料废弃物","zb":"研究对象为配对电催化技术，关键方法为将硝酸盐还原与生物质和塑料废弃物阳极氧化耦合，主要结果为该技术能降低电池电压，提高能量效率，并同步生产高产率的有价值产品。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.langmuir.5c04125","t":"Enhancing Tandem Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Through Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF Composite Nanoflower","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.langmuir.5c04125","s":"Langmuir","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (eNO3RR) has gained widespread application as a green and efficient technique for ammonia synthesis. However, the accumulation of nitrite (NO2-) during the electrochemical reduction process significantly hampers the efficiency of converting nitrate (NO3-) into ammonia (NH3). In this study, a Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF composite catalyst was developed on a nickel foam substrate using a hydrothermal method. The catalyst is composed of interconnected Cu-MOF@NF and Co-MOF@NF nanosheets, forming a flower-like nanostructure. X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) reveals there is an electronic transfer between copper (Cu) and cobalt (Co) sites at the interface of Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF, thereby accelerating both the adsorption and reduction of NO3- at Cu sites and enhancing selective conversion to NH3 at Co sites. At a potential of - 0.5 V vs RHE, the Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF exhibi","au":["Sixiang Mao","Yunqing Zhu","Gaigai Dong","Tian Wang","Fan Pan","Kejing Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF 复合纳米花增强串联电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 Cu-MOF/Co-MOF@NF 复合纳米花催化剂，关键方法为水热法制备，主要结果为在 -0.5 V vs RHE 下，硝酸盐转化为氨的效率 surpasses Cu-MOF@NF 和 Co-MOF@NF 分别 8.5% 和 39.6%，氨选择性和产率为 93.3% 和 318.5 μg·h-1·cm-2。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/jeq2.70094","t":"Improving nitrogen management in US agriculture: Yield Reserve versus land retirement","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jeq2.70094","s":"Journal of Environmental Quality","d":"2025-10-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Pressure to protect and restore water quality continues to drive demand for greater reductions in nitrogen (N) loads from US agriculture. Researchers have been evaluating agricultural production choices along both the extensive and intensive margins to improve ecosystem services. This study uses the US Department of Agriculture's Regional Environment and Agriculture Programming (REAP) model, a partial equilibrium simulation model that integrates agricultural production, land use, and environmental outcomes, to evaluate the cost‐effectiveness of a Yield Reserve Program compared to an expansion of the Conservation Reserve Program (CRP) on revenues, costs, output, and potential reductions in N loads from the production of 10 major crops, both nationally and regionally. The findings indicate that the Yield Reserve Program outperforms the CRP in terms of achieving N reduction under e","au":["Chenyang Hu","Wei Zhang","Darrell Bosch"],"o":"回填","zt":"改善美国农业氮管理：产量储备与土地退耕","zb":"本研究利用REAP模型评估了在同等政府预算下，产量储备计划与扩大保护性退耕计划(CRP)在减少氮负荷方面的成本效益。结果表明产量储备计划在减少氮负荷方面优于CRP，但玉米种植面积的“反弹效应”部分抵消了这一效果。CRP扩张表现出强烈的“滑移效应”，导致氮负荷减少低于预期。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202519797","t":"Local Enhanced Electric Field Assisted Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Using Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF Nanostructures","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202519797","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2025-10-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Environmentally sustainable electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) is a very promising method for the synthesis of ammonia at room temperature via the complex eight‐electron/nine‐proton transfer mechanism. Herein, the local electric field‐assisted electrochemical NO 3 RR process is proposed to identify the origin of catalytic activity and charge transfer kinetics resulting from different morphologies of the electrocatalyst. Accordingly, Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF nanorods (NRs) and nanotips (NTs) are fabricated on Ni foam as electrocatalysts for the NO 3 RR. The Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF NTs exhibits an impressive ammonia yield of up to 11286.9 µg h −1 cm − 2 and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 83.7% at −1.0 V versus RHE, representing nearly a 2.2‐fold increase in yield compared to the Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF NRs. This greater performance is attributed to the local enhanced electric field (LEEF) generated ","au":["Nilmadhab Mukherjee","Ashadul Adalder","Sourav Paul","Narad Barman","Ranjit Thapa","Koushik Mitra"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"局部增强电场辅助电催化硝酸盐还原为氨使用 Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF 纳米结构","zb":"提出局部电场辅助的电化学硝酸盐还原 (NO 3 RR) 过程，以识别不同形貌的电催化剂引起的催化活性和电荷转移动力学来源。Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF 纳米尖 (NTs) 在 -1.0 V versus RHE 下表现出高达 11286.9 µg h −1 cm − 2 的氨产率，以及 83.7% 的法拉第效率，与 Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF 纳米棒 (NRs) 相比，产率提高了近 2.2 倍。这种更好的性能归因于在尖状 Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF NTs 处产生的局部增强电场 (LEEF)。此外，开发了一种 Zn–NO 3 − 电池，Ni(TCNQ) 2 /NF NTs 显示出最大功率密度为 2.15 mW cm −2 。实验和计算结果证明，纳米结构形状的几何和电学特性通过增强电荷转移动力学，显著影响电化学 NO 3 RR。该研究旨在通过在电催化剂中战略控制局部电场强度，推进形态依赖","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.7868/s3034605325010072","t":"Research into the possibility of gas utilization with different nitrogen content for ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.7868/s3034605325010072","s":"Теоретические основы химической технологии / Theoretical Foundations of Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The paper studies the possibility of ammonia production from natural gases ballasted with inert components on the example of nitrogen-methane mixture with nitrogen content from 0 to 43 vol. %. The processes of steam, autothermal conversion, steps of nitrogen-hydrogen mixture preparation and the process of ammonia synthesis on the basis of thermodynamic data are considered.","au":["M.Kh. Sosna"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"利用不同氮含量气体进行氨合成的可能性研究","zb":"本文基于热力学数据，研究了利用含惰性组分的天然气生产氨气的可能性。研究以氮含量从0到43 vol.%的氮-甲烷混合物为例，分析了蒸汽转化、自热转化、氮氢混合气制备及氨合成过程。"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cy01037c","t":"Progress in the catalyst design and mechanistic elucidation of the thermocatalytic production of green ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cy01037c","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2025-10-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":25,"ab":"While the Haber-Bosch process enables large-scale industrial ammonia production, harsh operation conditions together with fossil fuel-derived hydrogen underscore the urgency for the development of efficient green ammonia synthesis strategies considering...","au":["Yixiao Lin","Xingqi Li","Wei Mao","Jiabao Lv","Ang Cao","Lujie Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"热催化绿色氨合成催化剂设计与机理研究进展","zb":"针对Haber-Bosch工艺能耗高及依赖化石燃料制氢的问题，本文综述了热催化绿色氨合成催化剂的设计策略与反应机理。文章探讨了在温和条件下实现高效氨合成的关键科学问题，旨在推动可持续的绿色氨生产技术发展。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202514834","t":"Interfacial Synergistic Hydrogen Spillover and Electron Transfer for Boosting Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202514834","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2025-10-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Nitrate overabundance in wastewater brings environmental pollution and health risks, while the traditional Haber−Bosch process for ammonia production is accompanied by huge energy consumption and carbon emissions. Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 − RR) can use renewable energy to produce green ammonia and provide a sustainable route for wastewater treatment. Electrochemical NO 3 − RR process involves multiple proton‐coupled‐electron steps; however, simultaneous optimization of proton and electron transfer is still challenging, leading to poor selectivity for ammonia production. Here, the interfacial synergism of hydrogen spillover and electron transfer is demonstrated to boost electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia. Experimental and theoretical calculation results show that the interface hydrogen spillover of CoNi–layered double hydroxide (LDH) accelerate","au":["Muyun Zheng","Yuchi Wan","Zheng‐Hong Huang","Feiyu Kang","Ruitao Lv"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"界面协同氢溢流和电子转移以提升电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO 3 − RR) 可以利用可再生能源生产绿色氨，并为废水处理提供可持续路线。实验和理论计算结果表明，CoNi–层状双氢氧化物 (LDH) 的界面氢溢流加速了 NO 3 − RR 的加氢步骤，而 Cu 2 O 的电子转移促进了吸附的 NO 3 − 的还原。受益于界面协同氢溢流和电子转移，CoNi–LDH@Cu 2 O 催化剂在 -0.3 V versus RHE 下实现了 97.8% 的法拉第效率，在约 1 A cm −2 的工业相关电流密度下，氨产率高达 75.2 mg h −1 cm −2 。这项工作为通过界面设计策略增强 NO 3 − RR 性能以处理废水硝酸盐和绿色氨合成提供了见解。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.5c11903","t":"Direct and Sustainable Ammonia Synthesis from Air and Water with Sulfur-Deficient MoS 2 Piezocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.5c11903","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2025-10-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Eco-friendly ammonia (NH3) production is critical for advancing sustainable agriculture and industry. This study introduces a sustainable, cleaner approach using MoS2 nanoflowers (NFs) to synthesize NH3 directly from water and air without the need for sacrificial agents. The advanced design leverages double sulfur vacancies (V2s) in MoS2 NFs (V2s-MoS2 NFs) and their piezoelectric properties, achieving a noteworthy production efficiency of 8374.8 ± 140.1 μmol L–1 g–1 h–1 (absolute production rate of 0.84 ± 0.01 μmol h–1). This outperforms most existing photocatalysts and piezocatalysts and rivals advanced electrocatalysts. The catalyst demonstrated exceptional stability, producing 36.55 mmol L–1 g–1 (equivalent to an absolute yield of 3.655 μmol) with N2 and 26.03 mmol L–1 g–1 (equivalent to an absolute yield of 2.603 μmol) with air over 8 h. In situ Raman spectroscopy revealed intensifyi","au":["Yu-Ching Chen","Yin-Song Liao","Po-Han Chen","Jyh-Pin Chou","Cheng-Kuo Tsai","Yi-Dong Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"使用硫缺陷 MoS 2 压电催化剂直接和可持续地合成氨从空气和水","zb":"本研究介绍了一种可持续、更清洁的方法，使用 MoS2 纳米花 (NFs) 直接从水和空气中合成 NH3，无需牺牲剂。该先进设计利用 MoS2 NFs (V2s-MoS2 NFs) 中的双硫空位 (V2s) 及其压电特性，实现了 8374.8 ± 140.1 μmol L–1 g–1 h–1 的显著生产效率（绝对生产率为 0.84 ± 0.01 μmol h–1）。这优于大多数现有的光催化剂和压电催化剂，并与先进的电催化剂相媲美。该催化剂表现出优异的稳定性，在 8 小时内用 N2 产生 36.55 mmol L–1 g–1（相当于绝对产率为 3.655 μmol），用空气产生 26.03 mmol L–1 g–1（相当于绝对产率为 2.603 μmol）。原位拉曼光谱显示，在 N2 气下，~819 和 993 cm–1 处的峰强度增强，归因于 Mo–N 伸缩振动。此外，原位漫反射红外傅里叶变","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.59400/esc3826","t":"Ammonia synthesis and decomposition mediated by hydrides, imides, and amides","u":"https://doi.org/10.59400/esc3826","s":"Energy Storage and Conversion","d":"2025-10-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is used for global fertilizer production and is increasingly viewed as a viable carrier for renewable hydrogen and long-duration energy storage. Realizing this potential requires catalysts and process architectures that enable both N₂-to-NH₃ synthesis and NH₃-to-H₂ decomposition at substantially reduced temperature and pressure. This review surveys recent advances in which alkali- and alkaline-earth metal hydrides, amides, and imides act as dynamic redox and hydrogen/nitrogen-transfer media, undergoing reversible interconversion with N₂, H₂, and NH₃. We summarize thermocatalytic systems where hydridic H⁻ and electron-rich lattices promote N₂ activation, heterolytic H₂ cleavage, and N–H bond formation, including composite catalysts that exploit cooperative interfaces with transition metals and complex or mixed-anion hydrides that relax constraints imposed by conventional metal-onl","au":["Muhammad Anis Aslam","Sajad Hussain","Ismat Ullah Khan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"由氢化物、酰亚胺和酰胺介导的氨合成和分解","zb":"氨用于全球化肥生产，并且越来越多地被视为一种可行的可再生氢载体和长期储能载体。实现这种潜力需要能够在大幅降低的温度和压力下实现 N₂ 到 NH₃ 合成和 NH₃ 到 H₂ 分解的催化剂和工艺架构。本综述调查了碱金属和碱土金属氢化物、酰胺和酰亚胺作为动态氧化还原和氢/氮转移介质的最新进展，它们与 N₂、H₂ 和 NH₃ 进行可逆互变。我们总结了热催化系统，其中氢性的 H⁻ 和富电子的晶格促进了 N₂ 活化、异裂 H₂ 断裂和 N–H 键形成，包括利用过渡金属与复杂或混合阴离子氢化物协同界面作用的复合催化剂，这些氢化物放宽了传统纯金属表面施加的限制。我们还讨论了利用氢化物中缺陷稳定电荷载体在光照下驱动氮转换的光辅助路线，以及化学链策略，将氮固定与加氢（或氢释放）解耦以调节热力学并减轻竞争吸附。在这些平台上，反复出现的主题包括晶格介导的氢/质子穿梭、界面电子捐赠以及可逆的氮化物-酰亚胺-酰胺形成","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c11505","t":"Effective Ammonia Production from Nitrogen and Water under Ambient Conditions through Proton-Coupled In Situ Radiolytic Electron Transfer","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11505","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is a vital component for sustaining global food supplies and fuel production, but its industrial production via the Haber-Bosch process remains energetically demanding and carbon-intensive. Here, we report an electron-beam-activated NH3 synthesis strategy that utilizes only atmospheric N2 and water as feedstocks under ambient conditions. This approach achieves an industrially relevant rate of 83.6 μmol g-1 s-1 with a substantially improved energy efficiency of 0.53 MJ/mol, which surpasses most laboratory-scale technologies and is comparable to that of the Haber-Bosch process. Time-resolved operando spectroscopic experiments, combined with theoretical calculations, reveal that this distinct activation mode enables rapid N2→NH3 conversion through a proton-coupled transfer of an in situ generated energetic hydrated electron. Furthermore, techno-economic analysis and life-cycle","au":["Changjiang Hu","Junyi Zhao","Ruisi Chang","Hui Dong","Zhiwen Jiang","Xiang Li"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"利用质子耦合原位辐射电子转移在室温下从氮和水制氨","zb":"本文报道了一种利用电子束激活的氨合成策略，仅以大气N2和水为原料在室温下进行反应。该方法实现了83.6 μmol g-1 s-1的产率和0.53 MJ/mol的能效，通过原位光谱和理论计算揭示了通过质子耦合转移原位生成的高能水合电子实现N2→NH3快速转化的机理。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","top":1},{"id":"10.1116/6.0004826","t":"On the impact of atomic layer deposition processing on the chemical and opto-electrical properties of NiO thin films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0004826","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Nickel oxide (NiO) is a promising p-type semiconductor extensively investigated for applications in photovoltaics, electrochemical energy storage, and gas sensors. Several deposition techniques, including solution processing, sputtering, chemical vapor deposition, and atomic layer deposition (ALD), are adopted for the synthesis of NiO films. Among these techniques, ALD is recognized for the merit of delivering pinhole-free and conformal films, relevant for processing on textured surfaces. In the present study, we have adopted three ALD NiO processes to deliver films differing in stoichiometry, crystallographic, and optoelectrical properties. To this purpose, the Ni(tBu-MeAMD)2-based thermal ALD process (“NiOBu-MeAMD”), the Ni(MeCp)2-based plasma-assisted ALD (PA-ALD) process (“NiOMeCp”), and the newly developed PA-ALD process, based on the novel AlanisTM precursor (“NiOAlanis”), are comp","au":["Kousumi Mukherjee","Cristian van Helvoirt","Christ H. L. Weijtens","Marcel Verheijen","Mariadriana Creatore"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积工艺对 NiO 薄膜化学和光电性能的影响","zb":"NiO 是一种有前景的 p 型半导体，广泛研究用于光伏、电化学储能和气体传感器。本研究比较了三种 ALD NiO 工艺，制备了化学计量、晶体学和光电性能不同的薄膜。NiOAlanis 基工艺在 150 °C 下对 c-Si/本征氧化层呈线性生长，每周期生长速率 (GPC) 为 0.27 ± 0.02 Å/cycle，与 NiOMeCp 工艺相似，而 NiOBu-MeAMD 工艺的 GPC 为 0.43 ± 0.01 Å/cycle。NiOAlanis 薄膜具有最低的 Ni 到 O 比率 (0.82 ± 0.04)，与 NiOMeCp (0.96 ± 0.05) 和 NiOBu-MeAMD (0.93 ± 0.05) 相比。NiOAlanis 薄膜中的过量氧表明 Ni3+ 受主态含量较高。Ni3+ 态导致亚带隙吸收，使 NiOAlanis 薄膜在可见光范围内的透光率较低 (∼79%)，与 N","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c07805","t":"Efficient Valorization of Biomass Waste to Green Hydrogen over Flash Joule Heating-Engineered High-Entropy Alloy Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c07805","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In the context of global energy transition and carbon neutrality goals, developing sustainable technologies for converting biomass waste into high-value green hydrogen (H 2 ) is critical for advancing cleaner production and a circular economy. This study presents a novel approach to synthesizing carbon-supported ultrasmall FeCoNiCuZn high-entropy alloy (HEA) nanoparticles via flash Joule heating (FJH) carbothermal shock, enabling efficient catalytic valorization of poplar sawdust waste into H 2 . The FJH process at 1000 °C suppresses volatile metal (e.g., Zn) loss and promotes rapid reduction, yielding high-density active sites with enhanced metallic states. Structural characterizations confirm the formation of a single-phase face-centered cubic HEA structure, uniformly dispersed on nitric acid-modified biochar with strong metal-support interactions, stabilized by oxygen-containing funct","au":["Jian Lin","Quan Yao","Xin Lin","Dechao Wang","Kaiyue Wu","Haihan Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"生物质废弃物高效转化为绿色氢气使用闪焦耳加热工程的高熵合金催化剂","zb":"利用闪蒸焦耳热碳热冲击法合成碳负载的超小 FeCoNiCuZn 高熵合金纳米颗粒，用于高效催化转化杨木锯末废料制氢。该催化剂具有高比表面积和强金属-载体相互作用，在 1000 °C 下处理 72 秒，H2 产率达到 23.56 mmol/g 干生物质。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c02775","t":"Preparation and Comparative Evaluation of Membrane Separators for Aqueous Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reaction Measurements","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c02775","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Catalyst screening for electrochemical nitrogen (N2) reduction to ammonia (NH3) suffers from spurious results caused by various sources of contamination associated with the experimental setup and the environment. As a crucial component of the electrochemical cell, a separator membrane is necessary to prevent the oxidation of as-synthesized NH3, specifically for low-yield aqueous electrochemical nitrogen reduction reactions (EC-N2RR). However, there remains a key need for a robust and contamination-free membrane, including systematic assessments of its electrochemical suitability for this reaction. Here, we report a simple yet effective cleaning process for the recently introduced microporous Celgard membrane. We show that the cleaned Celgard membrane outperforms other commonly used EC-N2RR membranes in alkaline electrolytes, exhibiting superior ion transport compared to a Nafion proton e","au":["Maximilian Christis","Xiang Li","Johannes Dittloff","Julius Kühne","Verena Streibel","Ian D. Sharp"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"用于水相电化学氮还原反应测量的膜分离器的制备与比较评估","zb":"研究对象为用于水相电化学氮还原反应(EC-N2RR)的膜分离器，关键方法为制备和评估不同膜材料(如Celgard、Nafion、Fumasep)的电化学适用性，主要结果为经过清洗的Celgard膜在碱性电解质中表现出优于Nafion和Fumasep的离子传输性能、化学惰性和结构稳定性，为EC-N2RR催化剂筛选提供了可靠方法。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"ChemRxiv","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5gc04170h","t":"Coupling of oxygen vacancies and an anatase/TiO 2 (B) phase junction for promoting photocatalytic performance of platinum toward ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5gc04170h","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis under ambient condition represents a sustainable pathway compared to the Haber–Bosch process, but its efficiency is immensely limited by poor charge separation and the weak capability to...","au":["Di Lei","Jinhan Liu","Xianwei Zhang","Guangming Wang","Yan Wang","Rong Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过氧空位和锐钛矿/TiO2(B)相结耦合促进铂光催化氨合成性能","zb":"研究对象为铂(Pt)在氧空位和锐钛矿/TiO2(B)相结耦合作用下的光催化氨合成性能，关键方法为制备Pt/TiO2催化剂并研究氧空位和相结对光催化性能的影响，主要结果为氧空位和相结协同作用显著提升了Pt的光催化性能，但摘要未提供具体数值数据。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.5c02904","t":"One-Pot Thermal Plasma Synthesis of Hybrid Nanostructures with Ni NPs on BNNT Surface for Stable and Efficient Catalytic Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.5c02904","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A hybrid nanomaterial comprising Ni nanoparticles (NPs) grown on the outer walls of boron nitride nanotubes (BNNTs) was synthesized using a one-pot, in situ, mass-production thermal plasma method. The Ni/BNNT nanomaterial, with Ni NPs separately distributed on BNNT surfaces, preserved the hollow tubular structure of BNNTs and the catalytic activity of Ni NPs. Morphological, structural, and compositional analyses revealed well-crystallized Ni NPs, averaging less than 6 nm in diameter and accounting for 30% of the volume concentration, on BNNT surface. At a gas hourly space velocity of NH 3 of 12,820 mL g –1 h –1, Ni/BNNTs achieved 100% NH 3 conversion at 750 °C with an apparent activation energy of 71.4 kJ mol –1 . Additionally, a 100 h long-term NH 3 decomposition test demonstrated the excellent thermal stability of Ni/BNNTs, with no aggregation of Ni NPs or loss of catalytic performance","au":["Hee Il Yoo","Byongjoo Bark","Sang-Woo Jeon","Sung-Hwan Lim","Shin-Hyun Kang","Tae-Hwan Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"一锅热等离子体合成BNNT表面Ni纳米粒子负载的混合纳米结构用于稳定高效的氨分解催化","zb":"研究对象为Ni纳米粒子(NPs)负载在氮化硼纳米管(BNNT)表面的混合纳米材料，关键方法为采用一锅热等离子体方法合成Ni/BNNT材料，主要结果为Ni/BNNT在750 °C下氨转化率为100%，表观活化能为71.4 kJ mol-1，100小时氨分解测试表明Ni/BNNT具有良好的热稳定性，Ni NPs无团聚且催化性能保持。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c14551","t":"Boosting Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia through Active Co–P Catalytic Centers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c14551","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia is a promising approach for nitrogen resource recovery and environmental remediation. In this study, we investigate the catalytic performance of cobalt phosphide incorporated in the carbon skeleton (CoP/C) as an efficient catalyst for this reaction. The strong interaction between Co and P constructs a unique electronic structure for the catalyst, enabling its catalytic performance and stability to be significantly superior to that of metal Co, cobalt phosphate (Co(PO3)2), or cobalt oxide (Co3O4). In situ Raman spectroscopy and online differential electrochemical mass spectrometry were employed to identify the intermediate products formed during the catalytic process, providing valuable insights into the reaction mechanism. Furthermore, first-principles calculations highlighted the significant role of Co-P active species in promoting the","au":["Fengcai Lei","Ying Wang","Junling Zhang","Jingyi Zhang","Bohan Wang","Yuhan Hou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过活性Co-P催化中心提升高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为负载在碳骨架上的钴磷化物(CoP/C)，关键方法为制备CoP/C催化剂并采用电化学方法进行硝酸盐还原为氨，主要结果为CoP/C催化剂在-0.2 V vs RHE下峰法拉第效率为97.5%，在-0.6 V vs RHE下峰氨产率为4.2 mol gcat-1 h-1，Co-P相互作用显著提升了催化剂的选择性和稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c04123","t":"Nature of the Lithium Amide–Imide Catalyst System under Ammonia Decomposition Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.5c04123","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The varying stoichiometry of the lithium amide–imide ammonia decomposition catalyst under working conditions was ascertained by calculating the gas release events in the ammonia decomposition experiments. Rather than varying smoothly between amide and imide, the gas releases showed evidence of a molten state with a majority of amide stoichiometry before converting at temperatures above 460 °C to a solid with a majority of imide stoichiometry. At higher temperatures, there was indirect evidence of nitride hydride groups being formed within the catalyst structure.","au":["Thomas J. Wood","Eleanor G. Frew"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"在氨分解条件下锂酰胺-亚酰胺催化剂体系的性质","zb":"通过计算氨分解实验中的气体释放事件，确定了锂酰胺-亚酰胺氨分解催化剂在工作条件下的化学计量变化。气体释放事件显示，催化剂在 460 °C 以上的温度下从以酰胺为主的熔融状态转变为以亚酰胺为主的固态，而非在酰胺和亚酰胺之间平滑变化。在较高温度下，催化剂结构中形成了氮化氢基团的间接证据。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202501716","t":"Synergistic Photothermal Catalysis of 3d Transition Metal‐Lithium Hydride Composites for Low‐Temperature Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202501716","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia synthesis under mild conditions remains a critical yet formidable challenge in sustainable energy research. In this study, we report a novel photothermal ammonia synthesis strategy employing synergistic 3d transition metal‐lithium hydride (TMs‐LiH) composites. The TMs‐LiH system (comprising V‐, Cr‐, Mn‐, Fe‐, Co‐, and Ni‐LiH composites) exhibits universal catalytic performance at low temperatures (100–200 °C), forming a characteristic “plateau curve” that indicates ammonia synthesis activity is less dependent on the specific TM component. Crucially, catalytic activity collapses entirely under identical thermal conditions in the absence of light, underscoring the pivotal role of photothermal effects in activating the reactants. Notably, compared to conventional thermochemical ammonia synthesis, the TMs‐LiH catalysts under light illumination demonstrate a significant reduction in a","au":["Tongtong Zhang","Shasha Ge","Hongliang Liang","Fei Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"3d 过渡金属-锂氢化物复合材料协同光热催化低温氨合成","zb":"研究对象为3d过渡金属-锂氢化物(TMs-LiH)复合材料，关键方法为制备不同过渡金属的LiH复合材料并采用光热催化进行氨合成，主要结果为TMs-LiH复合材料在100–200 °C下表现出通用催化性能，形成特征性“平台曲线”，表明氨合成活性与具体过渡金属成分关系不大，光照条件下催化活性显著增强，Fe-LiH复合材料表现出最高催化活性。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-7755852/v1","t":"Room-Temperature Superconductivity at 298 K in Ternary La-Sc-H System at High-pressure Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-7755852/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2025-10-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Room-temperature superconductor has been a century-long dream of humankind. Recent research on hydrogen-based superconductors (e.g., CaH 6 , LaH 10 , etc.) at high-pressure conditions lifts the record of superconducting critical temperature ( T c ) up to ~250 kelvin. We here report the experimental synthesis of the first-ever room-temperature superconductor by compression on a mixture of La-Sc alloy and ammonia borane at pressures of 250-260 gigapascals (GPa) via a diamond anvil cell by a laser-heating technique. Superconductivity with an onset temperature of 271-298 kelvin at 195-266 GPa is observed by the measurement of zero electrical resistance and the suppression of T c under applied magnetic fields. Synchrotron X-ray diffraction data unambiguously reveal that this superconductor crystallizes in a hexagonal structure with a stoichiometry LaSc 2 H 24 , in excellent agreement","au":["Guangtao Liu"],"o":"回填","zt":"在高压条件下 298 K 下在 La-Sc-H 三元体系中实现室温超导","zb":"通过金刚石对顶砧在 250-260 GPa 压力下用激光加热技术压缩 La-Sc 合金和氨硼烷混合物，实验合成了首个室温超导体。在 195-266 GPa 下观察到超导性，起始温度为 271-298 K，表现为零电阻和磁场下的 Tc 抑制。同步辐射 X 射线衍射数据证实该超导体具有六方结构，化学计量为 LaSc2H24，与先前预测一致。通过 13 次可重复实验，首次提供了室温超导体实现的实验证据。","ob":"氨硼烷水解","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta06585b","t":"Graphene accelerates electron transfer over copper-cobalt nanoparticles for efficient electroreduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta06585b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-10-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A novel CuCo–Gr0.1 electrode with enhanced electron transfer properties through graphene decoration was developed. CuCo–Gr0.1 exhibits outstanding NO 3 − RR performance, enabling dual-function nitrate-to-ammonia conversion and uranyl ion removal.","au":["Yi Li","Junbo Zeng","Jiahao Mo","Fuping Zhou","Tao Duan","Youkui Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"石墨烯加速铜钴纳米颗粒上的电子转移用于高效的硝酸电还原为氨","zb":"开发了一种通过石墨烯修饰具有增强电子转移性能的 CuCo–Gr0.1 电极。CuCo–Gr0.1 表现出优异的 NO3−RR 性能，实现硝酸盐到氨的双功能转化和铀酰离子去除。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-x74kh","t":"Ammonia Adsorption onto MFI Zeolite Nanosheets","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-x74kh","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-10-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"MFI zeolite nanosheets membranes are promising candidates for ammonia separation from nitrogen and hydrogen, yet questions remain on the origin of their high selectivity. Silanols, Si-OH, are present in high concentration at the surface of zeolite nanosheets, and force-field-based simulations indicate that surface adsorption at the silanols contributes to selectivity. Silanols can chemically react with ammonia, which may further contribute to the ability of zeolite nanosheet membranes to separate it from other gases. In this work, we use first-principles molecular dynamics techniques to simulate ammonia’s behavior within stacked MFI zeolite nanosheets. We find that at 523 K and a loading corresponding to 35 bar, conditions desired for the ammonia separation, about 30% of ammonia reacts with surface silanols. Our work explores H-bonding and proton transfer within this system.","au":["Ramanish Singh","Nathan Wang","Henry Wolters","Prerna Prerna","Michael Tsapatsis","J. Ilja Siepmann"],"o":"回填","zt":"MFI 沸石纳米片上的氨吸附","zb":"MFI 沸石纳米片膜是分离氨和氮、氢的潜在候选材料，但其高选择性的来源仍有疑问。表面存在高浓度的硅醇（Si-OH），力场模拟表明表面吸附在硅醇上有助于选择性。硅醇可以与氨发生化学反应，这可能进一步有助于沸石纳米片膜分离其他气体的能力。本研究使用第一性原理分子动力学技术模拟氨在堆叠的 MFI 沸石纳米片中的行为。在 523 K 和对应 35 bar 的负载条件下，约 30% 的氨与表面硅醇反应。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","pre":1},{"id":"10.7868/s3034553725020205","t":"Comparison of the catalytic properties of Pt and Co cathodes for the nitrite reduction reaction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.7868/s3034553725020205","s":"Журнал физической химии / Russian Journal of Physical Chemistry","d":"2025-10-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reaction reduction of nitrites (NO2−RR) in a neutral aqueous electrolyte is studied, which has important applications both for future ammonia synthesis processes and for effective wastewater and agricultural wastewater treatment. The catalytic activity is compared (the results of the Faradaic efficiency and the yield rate of ammonia are obtained) for noble (platinum) and non-noble (cobalt) metals. Metallic polycrystalline platinum and cobalt serve as electrocatalyst. The surface of the catalysts is analyzed using SEM and light microscopy. The method of linear voltammetry is used to preliminarily identify the potential of ammonia synthesis and estimate the synthesis current density. The values of Faradaic efficiency (FE) and the yield rate of ammonia release are obtained for the five selected values of current densities (J). It is found that the cobalt cathode is more ","au":["I. I. Kuznetsova"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Pt 和 Co 阴极在亚硝酸还原反应中生成氨的催化性能比较","zb":"研究了中性水溶液电解质中亚硝酸盐（NO2−RR）的电化学反应还原，该反应对未来氨合成过程以及有效处理废水和农业废水具有重要意义。比较了贵金属（铂）和非贵金属（钴）的催化活性（获得法拉第效率和氨产率）。金属多晶铂和钴作为电催化剂。使用扫描电子显微镜和光学显微镜分析催化剂表面。采用线性伏安法初步确定氨合成的电位并估计合成电流密度。获得五个选定电流密度（J）下的法拉第效率和氨释放产率。研究发现钴阴极效率更高（FE ≈ 99%，产率 (NH3) = 2.4 mmol h–1 cm–2），超过铂阴极（FE = 88.1%，产率 (NH3) = 0.4 mmol h–1 cm–2）。确定了电催化剂的电活性表面积。根据工作结果解释了催化剂的活性，表明非贵金属阴极对 NO2−RR 更有效。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-5813(25)60570-6","t":"Progress in the modulation strategies of heterogeneous catalysts for ammonia synthesis by nitric oxide reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-5813(25)60570-6","s":"Journal of Fuel Chemistry and Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Na LI","Yanyan YANG","Song YANG","Zhongliang YU"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"一氧化氮还原合成氨多相催化剂调控策略进展","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116224","t":"Machine Learning Accelerated Interfacial Fluxionality in Ni-Supported Metal Nitride Ammonia Synthesis Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116224","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Pranav Roy","Brandon C. Bukowski"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"机器学习加速 Ni 支撑金属氮化物氨合成催化剂的界面流动性研究","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114999","t":"Co-doping g-C3N4 with tungsten and phosphorus for efficient photofixation of nitrogen to ammonia, degradation of organic pollutants, Cr (VI) reduction, and antibacterial activity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114999","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Communications","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Nguyen Huu Hieu","Tran Do Dat","Hoang An","Nguyen Thanh Hoai Nam","Tran Dang Khoa","Nguyen Hung Vu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen to ammonia"],"zt":"W和P共掺杂g-C3N4用于高效光固氮合成氨、降解有机污染物、Cr(VI)还原及抗菌活性","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151383","t":"Stabilizing and promoting Ru catalysts on nitrogen doped carbon for ammonia synthesis via cerium doping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151383","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Jia Huang","Haihong Tu","Yadong Pu","Zhixiong You"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过掺铈稳定和促进氮掺杂碳上用于氨合成的Ru催化剂","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135505","t":"Thermodynamic and kinetic analysis of autothermal syngas-generating limestone calcination process for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135505","s":"Fuel","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Arian Ebneyamini","Zezhong John Li","Yeon Jae Lee","C. Jim Lim","Naoko Ellis","John R. Grace"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氨合成自热合成气生成石灰石煅烧过程的热力学与动力学分析","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cep.2025.110429","t":"Investigation of the limits of unconventional ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cep.2025.110429","s":"Chemical Engineering and Processing - Process Intensification","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Irem Taspinar","Ahmet K. Avci"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"非传统氨合成极限的研究","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.vacuum.2025.114504","t":"Photocatalytic Properties of Thin Zno Films Synthesised with Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition at Room Temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.vacuum.2025.114504","s":"Vacuum","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Daria Jardas Babić","Robert Peter","Marko Perčić","Krešimir Salamon","Damjan Vengust","Tina Radošević"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"室温等离子体增强原子层沉积合成的薄ZnO膜的光催化性能","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.vacuum.2025.114457","t":"Process and Characteristics of Cobalt Films Deposited by Thermal Atomic Layer Deposition and Silicide Film Formed","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.vacuum.2025.114457","s":"Vacuum","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Shuai Yang","Jianfeng Gao","Jinjuan Xiang","Weibing Liu","Yanpeng Hu","Zhenxing Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"热原子层沉积沉积的钴膜过程和特性及硅化物膜形成","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.susmat.2025.e01596","t":"Wood powder-derived porous carbon materials synthesis by highly efficient microwave-induced Carbothermal shock in molten salts for dye removal","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.susmat.2025.e01596","s":"Sustainable Materials and Technologies","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zhenlu Liu","Chenweijia He","Guangjie Yang","Shuijian He","Yulong Yang","Haoqi Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Carbothermal shock"],"zt":"木粉衍生多孔碳材料通过熔盐中高效微波诱导热冲击合成用于染料去除","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133312","t":"Ultra-fast Joule heating synthesis of homogeneous copper-based bimetallic catalysts for electrochemical nitrate-to-ammonium reduction in wastewater treatment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133312","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule","nh3"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jenn Fang Su","Minh-Son Hoang","Herma Dina Setiabudi"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"超快焦耳热合成均相铜基双金属催化剂用于废水处理中电化学硝酸盐至氨的还原","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.pnsc.2025.09.005","t":"High-temperature shock synthesis of PtRuIrMnFe high-entropy alloy nanocatalysts for an efficient hydrogen evolution reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pnsc.2025.09.005","s":"Progress in Natural Science: Materials International","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Liming Li","Peng Kang","Hangxing Ren","Xianming Yuan","Donghui Feng","Yuguang Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["High-temperature shock"],"zt":"高温冲击合成PtRuIrMnFe高熵合金纳米催化剂用于高效的析氢反应","ob":"析氢反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.nxmate.2025.101152","t":"Improved atomic layer deposition method enhances the unit catalytic activity of platinum catalyst in oxygen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nxmate.2025.101152","s":"Next Materials","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The construction of uniformly dispersed and low-loading platinum-containing catalysts is a challenging task to promote the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) in polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs) using highly efficient and relatively low-cost catalysts. Here, we propose a strategy to prepare active Pt catalysts with cluster structures by a simplified atomic layer deposition (ALD) method that does not require the incorporation of equipment such as a fluidized bed reactor to control the distribution of carriers in the reaction chamber. Unlike the conventional ALD methods, the deposition of precious metal Pt on carbon aerogel (CA) does not require O 3 or O 2 to participate in all reactions, and the platinum content is directly controlled by the ALD cycle method, and a series of Pt@CA materials have successfully synthesized catalysts with different platinum content by adjusting th","au":["Xiaodi Tang","Ruizhuang Yang","JiangShan Luo","Lei Yuan","Xiaojiang He","Chaoyang Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"改进原子层沉积方法增强铂催化剂在氧还原反应中的单催化活性","zb":"提出一种简化的原子层沉积方法，无需流化床反应器等设备即可在碳气凝胶上制备具有簇结构的活性 Pt 催化剂。该方法通过调整脉冲和循环时间直接控制 Pt 含量，合成的 Pt@CA 催化剂具有更高的电化学活性表面积和单位质量活性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jmst.2025.02.014","t":"Highly air stable graphene p–n junctions encapsulated by atomic layer deposition for flexible and transparent wearable temperature sensors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmst.2025.02.014","s":"Journal of Materials Science & Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Soomook Lim","Hyun-Mi Kim","Seul-Gi Kim","Hyeongkeun Kim","Ji Won Suk"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积封装的高空气稳定石墨 p-n 结：用于柔性透明可穿戴温度传感器","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2025.113546","t":"Methane Pyrolysis by Joule Heating for Graphitic Carbon and Hydrogen Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2025.113546","s":"iScience","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The global energy transition toward sustainability requires technologies that can decarbonize energy carriers and fuels while producing valuable materials. Methane, a primary component of natural gas, is both a high-energy-density fuel and a significant greenhouse gas. This study reports a new approach for methane pyrolysis utilizing Joule heating within the deposition substrate to drive the endothermic reaction. With electric current passing through a resistive porous carbon cloth, heat is generated to break C-H bonds of methane molecules. The decomposition of methane as it flows through the cloth results in hydrogen production and the formation of conformally layered graphite around the carbon fibers. The effects of input power, chamber pressure, feedstock flow rate, and process duration on hydrogen and graphite production are characterized via in-situ mass spectrometry and laser absor","au":["Abdalla Alghfeli","Hengrui Xu","Benjamin T. Heronimus","Barathan Jeevaretanam","R. Mitchell Spearrin","Timothy S. Fisher"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动的甲烷热解：用于制备石墨碳和氢气","zb":"研究对象为甲烷，关键方法为通过电阻性多孔碳布通电产生焦耳热驱动甲烷热解反应，主要结果为氢气生产，石墨碳沉积，甲烷转化率达 87%，石墨 Raman ID/IG 比为 0.1，d-spacing 为 3.38 Å。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1016/j.clay.2025.107889","t":"Synthesis of zeolite 4A from low-grade kaolin containing muscovite and quartz via ultrafast Joule heating route: A comparison with conventional calcination","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.clay.2025.107889","s":"Applied Clay Science","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jiahang Fan","Xianjie Liu","Mengyao Yang","Mingyong Liu","Qianchao Ma","Liangjie Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过超快焦耳热路线从含蒙脱石和石英的低品位高岭土合成 4A 型沸石：与传统煅烧的比较","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.07.068","t":"Relation between structural and photocatalytic properties of thin ZnO films synthesised by plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.07.068","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Daria Jardas Babić","Robert Peter","Krešimir Salamon","Damjan Vengust","Tina Radošević","Matejka Podlogar"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"等离子体增强原子层沉积合成的薄 ZnO 薄膜的结构与光催化性能关系","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.07.022","t":"Ultra-fast preparation of Cf/ZrB2 matrix composites with inhibited fiber degradation via heavy DC Joule heating and pressing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.07.022","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yingjun Liu","Yuhan Yao","Yimeizhi Sun","Song Liu","Yang Zhang","Hongfeng Dong"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"利用重直流焦耳热和压制制备的 Cf/ZrB2 基复合材料：抑制纤维降解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166995","t":"Joule heating-driven efficient catalytic oxidation of chlorobenzene over MnCe-nickel foam: A flexible and energy-efficient strategy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166995","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Fanxiang Meng","Yunfeng Ma","Xiaojun Ma","Ling Wang","Feiyi Zhou","Bingcheng Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动的氯苯高效催化氧化：一种灵活且节能的策略","ob":"其他催化反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166857","t":"Ultrafast joule heating synthesis of structurally tunable cross-linked Ni/N‑carbon fiber for enhanced CO2 electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166857","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Delei Yu","Yuan-Sheng Cheng","Yaohui Lv","Ning Zhang","Yuwen Cheng","Fang-Hui Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热超快速合成结构可调交联 Ni/N-碳纤维用于增强 CO2 电还原","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166572","t":"Preparation of CeO2/biochar composites by flash Joule heating and the research on its efficient removal performance of VOCs","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166572","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Lanxi Yu","Keliang Pan","Yi Tang","Wenyan Xu","Jin Chen","Renxi Fang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳加热制备 CeO2/生物炭复合材料及其对 VOCs 的高效去除性能研究","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.118704","t":"Developing the MOF-based PVDF-TiO2@NH2-MIL-125(Ti) nanohybrid photocatalytic membranes for organics and ammonia-nitrogen compounds removals from oil field produced water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.118704","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tutuk Djoko Kusworo","Meitri Bella Puspa","Andri Cahyo Kumoro","Mohd Hafiz Dzarfan Othman","Febio Dalanta"],"o":"回填","zt":"开发基于MOF的PVDF-TiO2@NH2-MIL-125(Ti)纳米杂化光催化膜，用于油田采出水中的有机物和氨氮化合物去除","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151795","t":"Defect-driven cobalt hydroxide with capacitive properties for enhanced nitrogen reduction catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151795","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hai-Jun Liu","Shuo Zhang","Qiu-Ju Fu","Xue-Bo Zhao","Qun-Wei Tang"],"o":"回填","zt":"缺陷驱动的钴氢氧化物具有电容特性，增强氮还原催化","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168090","t":"V-doped MoS2 enabled oriented-customization of the active site toward superior nitrogen reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168090","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Dezhi Wang","Bilong Liu","Yiyi Yangliu","Xufa Peng","Hao Fei","Zhuangzhi Wu"],"o":"回填","zt":"V掺杂MoS2实现活性位点定向定制，提升氮还原为氨的效率","bt":1},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2025.94907464","t":"Oxygen vacancy engineering on LiFe 0.5 Mn 1.5 O 4 spinel for continuous ammonia electrosynthesis from nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2025.94907464","s":"Nano Research","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) powered by green electricity holds sustainable potential for delocalizing ammonia production traditionally implemented by the Haber-Bosch process. Unfortunately, the poor efficiency caused by the inertness of nitrogen-nitrogen triple bond and low aqueous solubility of N2 gas, as well as the unsatisfactory reproducibility reflected by the frequent false positives, largely impede the development in this field. Herein, we demonstrate that LiFe0.5Mn1.5O4 spinel (LFMO) with rich oxygen vacancies is capable of achieving ambient NRR with a Faradaic efficiency of 21.52% and NH3 yield rate of 22.45 μg mgcat-1 h-1 in a H-type cell. Furthermore, hybridizing LFMO with reduced graphene oxide (rGO) on carbonized melamine sponge (CMS) to fabricate a composite cathode enables a high NH3 yield of 224 μg cm-2 h-1 in the membrane electrode assembly (MEA) wi","au":["Shuhao Yan","Caoyu Yang","Xuewei Huang","Xiao Ma","Chang Long","Lin Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氧空位工程LiFe0.5Mn1.5O4尖晶石用于从氮气连续合成氨","zb":"电化学氮还原反应（NRR）由绿色电力驱动，对传统哈伯-博施过程的氨生产具有可持续潜力。LiFe0.5Mn1.5O4尖晶石（LFMO）具有丰富的氧空位，在H型电池中实现环境NRR，法拉第效率为21.52%，氨产率为22.45 μg mgcat-1 h-1。将LFMO与碳化三聚氰胺海绵（CMS）上的还原石墨烯氧化物（rGO）杂化制备复合阴极，在膜电极组件（MEA）中实现224 μg cm-2 h-1的高氨产率，并具有稳健的可重复性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2025.107859","t":"Theoretical study of nitrate reduction to ammonia on dual-atom doped CoP(101) catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2025.107859","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Guozheng Zhao","Miao Yu","Chaozheng He"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"双原子掺杂CoP(101)催化剂上硝酸还原为氨气的理论研究","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133326","t":"Improved electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to nitrogen on CoFe-MoS2 cathode: Enhanced nitrate adsorption and optimized atomic hydrogen utilization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133326","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yue Zhao","Hao Chen","Yunlong Ma","Houfen Li","Rui Li","Sufang Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"CoFe-MoS2阴极上硝酸还原为氮气的电催化性能提升：增强硝酸吸附和优化原子氢利用","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mtchem.2025.103031","t":"Boosting electrochemical ammonia production via accelerating dinitrogen activation on electrospun mesoporous tungsten oxynitride nanofibers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mtchem.2025.103031","s":"Materials Today Chemistry","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jaehyuk Lee","Yong Hyun Moon","Hyun Jin Jung","InGyeom Kim","EunAe Cho","Youn Jeong Jang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过加速二氮活化提升电化学氨生产","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115323","t":"Theoretical revealing the nitrogen reduction reaction on FeMo dual-atom catalysts and the role of sulfur modification","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115323","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuan-Hui Xiao","Zi-Wei Ma","Tai-Rui Wu","Xin-Wei Wu","Lai-Ke Chen","Jian-De Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"理论揭示FeMo双原子催化剂上的氮还原反应及硫改性作用","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jmst.2025.01.047","t":"Enhanced electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia via anchoring CuNi alloy on oxygen vacancy-rich N-Ti3C2T","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmst.2025.01.047","s":"Journal of Materials Science & Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhichao Ma","Tianfang Yang","Jinrui Huang","Shixiang Hu","Bingcheng Ge","Yang Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"通过将 CuNi 合金锚定在富氧空位的 N-Ti3C2T 上增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.06.012","t":"Atomic vacancy engineering of Co(OH)F nanoarray toward high-performance ammonia electrosynthesis with waste plastics upgrading","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.06.012","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mingdan Wang","Qianyu Zhang","Kun Chen","Cong Lin","Huigang Wang","Yanying Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"Co(OH)F 纳米阵列的原子空位工程面向使用废塑料升级的高性能氨电合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.118539","t":"Pulsed electrocatalysis on iron-decorated copper foam enables efficient and selective ammonia synthesis from low-concentration nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.118539","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hanlong Liu","Siyao Zhang","Touqeer Premy","Chunpeng Zhang","Fangyuan Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在铁装饰铜泡沫上的脉冲电催化使从低浓度硝酸盐中合成氨高效且选择性强","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117979","t":"Monodispersed iron(II) phthalocyanine separated by hydrophobic polymeric ionic liquids for boosting electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction efficiency","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117979","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Daliang Liu","Jian Gong","Xinze Tao","Song Xue","Zhuoying Sun","Ying Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"通过疏水聚合物离子液体分离的单分散铁(II)酞菁用于提高电催化氮还原反应效率","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117848","t":"Enhancing the photocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction, acetaminophen degradation, and energy recovery in fuel cells via the heterojunction of B-doped g-C3N4/BiOBr","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117848","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Esakkinaveen Dhanaraman","Antonysamy Soundarya Mary","Atul Verma","Palanichamy Murugan","Yen-Pei Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"通过 B 掺杂 g-C3N4/BiOBr 异质结增强光催化氮还原反应、对乙酰氨基酚降解和燃料电池中能量回收","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117679","t":"Recent advances of photocatalysts for nitrogen reduction reaction and mechanism behind them: How and why modifications change properties","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117679","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jin Feng","Wenxing Xu","Xiaorui Xu","Xinlu Wang","Yan Wang","Fanjun Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"光催化剂用于氮还原反应的最新进展及其背后的机制：修改如何和为什么改变性质","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117425","t":"Constructing Ru single atoms decorated Cu2O for efficient CoFe-LDH/BiVO4 photoanode photoelectrochemical nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117425","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ziqian Gao","Qi Zhang","Yan Bai","Wen Dong","Houde She","Qizhao Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["photoelectrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"构建装饰有Ru单原子的Cu2O用于高效的CoFe-LDH/BiVO4光阳极光电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137895","t":"Theoretical study on one-dimensional carbon nitride doped with transition metal for highly efficient and selective nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137895","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The inert nature of N2 poses a significant challenge to the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR). In this study, we theoretically investigated one-dimensional (1D) carbon nitride nanowire (1D-C6N7) structures doped with various transition metals (TM) as potential NRR catalysts. Employing density functional theory (DFT) calculations, we elucidated the regulation of bonding interactions between the d orbitals of transition metals and p orbitals of nitrogen via the \"acceptance-donation\" mechanism. This interaction results in the redistribution of electrons, shifting antibonding orbitals below the Fermi level and weakening the adsorption of N2. Hence, adjusting the number of d electrons and the nature of orbital interactions can fine-tune the adsorption efficiency and NRR activity. Among the 11 transition metals studied, TM@1D-C6N7 (TM = Zr, Nb, Mo) exhibit significant potential for light-induc","au":["Chenxi Xia","Jianfeng Liu","Hongwei Li","Wei Wei","Qiu He","Lixue Xia"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"过渡金属掺杂的一维碳氮化物理论研究：用于高效和选择性氮还原反应","zb":"N2的惰性性质对氮还原反应（NRR）构成重大挑战。本研究通过密度泛函理论（DFT）计算，研究了掺杂各种过渡金属（TM）的一维（1D）碳氮化物纳米线（1D-C6N7）结构作为潜在NRR催化剂。阐明了过渡金属的d轨道与氮的p轨道之间的键合相互作用通过“接受-捐赠”机制进行调节。这种相互作用导致电子重新分布，将反键轨道移至费米能级以下，并减弱了N2的吸附。因此，调整d电子的数量和轨道相互作用性质可以微调吸附效率和NRR活性。在研究的11种过渡金属中，TM@1D-C6N7（TM = Zr, Nb, Mo）在N2转化为NH3的光诱导转换中表现出显著潜力，并在可见光谱中表现出高效吸收，表明它们作为有效的光催化剂用于NRR具有潜力。吸附自由能的分析揭示了成功抑制了竞争性的析氢反应（HER），突出了对NRR的优异选择性。通过使用从头算分子动力学（AIMD）验证结构稳定性，确定了Nb/Mo@1D-C6N7作","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137732","t":"Enhanced Oxygen Vacancies on Yttrium Oxide with Cobalt Oxide Loaded for Accelerating Hydrogen Production from Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137732","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia decomposition for hydrogen production has become a critical process in the development of hydrogen economy. Non-noble based material possesses great potential of application in thermal catalysis due to its low cost and appreciable theoretical catalytic activity. However, the durability of non-noble metal catalysts under prolonged operation remains a significant challenge. Herein, the cobalt oxide supported on yttrium oxide catalysts with enhanced oxygen vacancies via co-precipitation was reported by using urea serving as a pH stabilizer, followed by annealing process in an inert atmosphere. The formation of enhanced oxygen vacancies was demonstrated accelerated the NH bond division and nitrogen recombination-desorption, thereby enhancing the efficiency of thermal catalytic decomposition of ammonia. Based on such advantages, the synthesized 50CoO/Y2O3 catalyst exhibited optimal NH","au":["Qi Li","Meiling Fan","Haibo Tang","Yi Zhu","Xiege Huang","Haining Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"钴氧化物负载的钇氧化物上增强的氧空位用于加速氨分解制氢","zb":"氨分解制氢是氢经济中发展的关键过程。非贵金属材料因其低成本和可观的催化活性在热催化中具有巨大应用潜力，但其耐久性在长期运行中仍是一个重大挑战。本研究通过共沉淀法制备了钴氧化物负载的钇氧化物催化剂，并用尿素作为pH稳定剂，随后在惰性气氛中进行退火处理，增强了氧空位。氧空位的形成加速了NH键断裂和氮重组-脱附，从而提高了热催化分解氨的效率。合成的50CoO/Y2O3催化剂表现出最佳的氨分解性能，在550°C下，以20,000 mL·gcat-1·h-1的高气体时空速实现了98.6%的氨转化率，氢气产率为22.3 mmol·gcat-1·min-1。此外，该催化剂在120小时内保持了稳定的活性，无明显降解，表明非贵金属催化剂在热催化氨分解制氢中具有潜在竞争力。","ob":"氨分解制氢","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116339","t":"First-principles, data-guided screening and catalyst design: Unveiling energetic trade-offs in ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116339","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuna Song","Yanggeun Ju","Chaerin Son","Dasol Bae","You Jin Go","Sung Bong Kang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"基于第一性原理、数据引导的筛选和催化剂设计：揭示氨分解中的能量权衡","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116250","t":"Lithium nitride (Li3N) formation in lithium-mediated electrochemical ammonia synthesis can be enhanced with the right proton donor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116250","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Lithium-mediated electrochemical ammonia synthesis (LiMEAS) hinges on the formation of lithium nitride (Li 3 N) from dissociated nitrogen at a lithium surface. Although proton donors (PDs) are known to influence nitrogen activation, their specific role in promoting Li 3 N formation is still being investigated. Herein, we employ density functional theory (DFT) to examine the effects of 17 PDs on the stability and energetics of Li 3 N formation. We show that in the absence of PD, Li 3 N formation is consistently outcompeted by subsurface N 2 embedding and, in some cases, by surface N 2 adsorption. However, the introduction of PD species yields three distinct outcomes: (i) the PD remains intact during Li 3 N formation, (ii) the PD protonates Li 3 N, or (iii) the PD undergoes structural change. Notably, configurations in which the PD remains intact exhibited greater stability compared to sub","au":["Victor Azumah","Lance Kavalsky","Venkatasubramanian Viswanathan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在锂介导的电化学氨合成中，锂氮化物(Li3N)的形成可以通过合适的质子给予体增强","zb":"锂介导的电化学氨合成(LiMEAS)依赖于在锂表面从解离的氮形成锂氮化物(Li3N)。DFT研究了17种质子给予体(PDs)对Li3N形成稳定性和能学的效应。PD的引入产生三种不同结果：(i) PD在Li3N形成过程中保持完整，(ii) PD质子化Li3N，或(iii) PD发生结构变化。PD保持完整的构型比亚表面嵌入更稳定，这是由PD诱导的表面重构驱动的。增强的Li3N稳定性与向氮的电转移增加相关。PD的基本性促进完整构型的Li3N形成，而较高的酸性和极性则导致PD质子化和改变。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116223","t":"The importance of gas purity in catalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116223","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Catalysts for ammonia synthesis/decomposition are very sensitive to poisoning by oxygen-impurities in the feed. Here we show that the ≤1 ppm O-species present in the purest commercially available gasses can lead to a one order of magnitude drop in ammonia synthesis rate for an industrial Fe catalyst. Density Functional Theory calculations show that adsorbed O creates repulsive interactions that repel and destabilize N in neighboring sites. This inhibits the rate limiting N 2 dissociation and leads to the lower rate. A K/Ru/C catalyst also suffers from significant O-poisoning although the activity drop is only half as strong as for iron catalysts, indicating that O poisoning is a general phenomenon across different types of ammonia synthesis catalysts. An industrial Fe-based ammonia synthesis catalyst kept at room temperature can be used as a guard bed to clean the gas, but oxygen can sta","au":["Simon I. Hansen","Benjamin H. Sjølin","Ivano E. Castelli","Tejs Vegge","Anker D. Jensen","Jakob M. Christensen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"气体纯度在催化氨合成中的重要性","zb":"催化剂对进料中的氧杂质非常敏感。≤1 ppm的O物种会导致工业Fe催化剂的氨合成速率降低一个数量级。DFT计算表明，吸附的O会与相邻的N产生排斥相互作用，导致N不稳定，抑制N2解离速率。K/Ru/C催化剂也受到显著O中毒，活性下降仅为铁催化剂的一半。工业Fe基氨合成催化剂在室温下可用作保护层床清洁气体，但氧可以在4.4% O-coverage时开始穿透保护层床，因此需要在使用前验证给定保护层床的容量。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114969","t":"Adjacent boron-modified TiSiGeN4 for efficient photocatalytic nitrogen reduction: A comparison of doping and loading","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114969","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Communications","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shilong Feng","Zhe Sun","Hengrui Jian","Kaining Shi","Qianqian Shen","Jinbo Xue"],"o":"回填","why":["photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"邻近的硼改性TiSiGeN4用于高效的 photocatalytic 氮还原：掺杂和负载的比较","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151871","t":"Enhancement of low-temperature ammonia decomposition over potassium-promoted Ru/MgAl2O4 catalyst for clean hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151871","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hye Jin Kim","Young-eun Kim","Yougha Park","Unho Jung","Ki Wan Bong","Kee Young Koo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"在钾助剂的Ru/MgAl2O4催化剂上低温氨分解的增强用于清洁氢气生产","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuproc.2025.108256","t":"Enhanced artificial nitrogen fixation into ammonia via CNT-modified BiFeO3-TiO₂ heterojunction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuproc.2025.108256","s":"Fuel Processing Technology","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis from nitrogen and water is a promising avenue for energy development due to its potential for sustainable production. In this study, the BiFeO 3 -TiO 2 -CNT nanocomposite, produced via a facile sol-gel and hydrothermal method (with and without CNTs), effectively converts N 2 into ammonia, a modern, sustainable and H-based fuel. The optimized composite, BFO-10 %TiO₂-CNT, exhibited a remarkable ammonia production rate of 150.8 μmol/g·h under ambient conditions, exceeding the performance of other ratios. CNT inclusion enhanced the photocatalytic performance. The superiority of BiFeO 3 -TiO 2 -CNT nanocomposite solar energy materials was explained in terms of CNT's ability to increase the photocatalyst surface area and effective interaction with N 2 molecules and the positive effect on photon absorption. The BiFeO 3 –10 %TiO 2 -CNT nanocomposite showed signif","au":["Elnaz Fekri","Mir Saeed Seyed Dorraji","Morteza Vahedpour"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过CNT修饰的BiFeO3-TiO2异质结增强人工固氮合成氨","zb":"研究对象为BiFeO3-TiO2-CNT纳米复合材料，采用溶胶-凝胶和水热法制备，有效将N2转化为氨。优化复合材料的氨产率为150.8 μmol/g·h，优于其他比例。CNT的加入增强了光催化性能，通过增加光催化剂表面积和与N2分子的有效相互作用，以及正面的光吸收效应。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135425","t":"Fe-Co/Al-CeZr-M multi-shelled nanosphere catalysts derived from self-templated synthesis for hydrogen production by ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135425","s":"Fuel","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shanshan Hao","Chengchun Ding","Tao Wang","Songsheng Zheng","Zhaolin Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"源自自模板合成的 Fe-Co/Al-CeZr-M 多壳纳米球催化剂用于氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.energy.2025.137554","t":"Levelized cost analysis for renewable ammonia production in Chile","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.energy.2025.137554","s":"Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Renewable ammonia production is a crucial step towards decarbonizing energy-intensive industries, but its economic viability is hindered by high capital costs and renewable resource availability. We develop a stochastic optimization framework to estimate the levelized cost of ammonia (LCOA) in any location of the world, accounting for the variability in wind and solar energy. The methodology is based on optimizing the portfolio of renewable sources and the capacity of the ammonia production facility while ensuring three pillars of renewable ammonia production: additionality, temporal matching, and geographic correlation. The resulting model also accounts for climate variability across different years and is formulated as a stochastic linear programming problem. We use the proposed methodology to assess the economic feasibility of renewable ammonia production in Chile, identifying optimal","au":["David Pozo","Enzo Sauma","Ricardo Bolado-Lavín"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"智利可再生能源氨生产的平准化成本分析","zb":"研究开发随机优化框架以估计世界任何地点的氨（LCOA）平准化成本，考虑风能和太阳能的变异性。方法基于优化可再生能源组合和氨生产设施容量，同时确保可再生能源生产的三个支柱：增量性、时间匹配和地理相关性。模型还考虑了不同年份的气候变异性，并制定为随机线性规划问题。使用该方法评估智利可再生能源生产的经济可行性，根据可再生能源可用性和成本确定设施的最佳位置。数值实验表明，到 2040 年，智利具有竞争力的可再生能源生产 LCOA 可能在 270 至 380 USD/t NH3 之间，到 2050 年在 250 至 350 USD/t NH3 之间（取决于所使用的折现率），将智利定位为全球市场的竞争者。此外，结果表明，氨生产CAPEX降低对 LCOA 的影响大于电到氨效率提高的影响，这突出了优先考虑降低投资成本的重要性。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2025.146793","t":"Modulation of electrochemical nitrogen reduction by ionic liquids on MoS2 electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2025.146793","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Pablo A. Barraza","Jessica S. Honores","Elías G. Leiva","Domingo Ruiz- León","Rodrigo del Rio","Mauricio Isaacs"],"o":"回填","why":["electrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"离子液体对 MoS2 电极上电化学氮还原的调控","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2025.146747","t":"Highly selective and stable RuP2−MnP-NPC/CP nanocomposite as electrocatalyst for nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2025.146747","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ya-Fei Guo","Sajid Mahmood","Anum Bilal","Noshin Afsan","Noor Hassan","Ali Bahadur"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"高选择性和稳定的 RuP2−MnP-NPC/CP 纳米复合材料作为电催化剂将硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cplett.2025.142189","t":"Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction on Two-Dimensional Mn4-Contained Periodical Macrocyclic Structures: A Dft Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2025.142189","s":"Chemical Physics Letters","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xin Tong","Yanjun Chen","Liujiang Zhou","Huilong Dong"],"o":"回填","why":["Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen"],"zt":"锂介导的二维 Mn4-含周期性大环结构上的氮还原：DFT 研究","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168046","t":"Oxygen vacancy-assisted CuCo tandem catalyst boosts efficient electrocatalytic neutral ultralow-concentration nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168046","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xing Fan","Cui Lai","Lei Qin","Mingming Zhang","Huchuan Yan","Shiyu Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"氧空位辅助的 CuCo 联用催化剂高效电催化超低浓度硝酸盐转化为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.167497","t":"From nitrogen to ammonia to ammoniating natural biomass: The applying of photocatalysis in preparation the temperature and salt-resistant filtrate reducer","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.167497","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiao Luo","Peipei Wang","Xin Zhang","Jian Luo","Guiyou Hua","Qiang Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen to ammonia"],"zt":"从氮到氨到氨化天然生物质：光催化在制备耐温耐盐滤液减压器中的应用","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.167002","t":"Tailoring key intermediates and interfacial water at Ag92Ru8 aerogel toward sustainable ammonia synthesis from nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.167002","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Junjie Chen","Xiaomei Xing","Sisi Wen","Mengyuan Li","Di Liu","Wenji Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在 Ag92Ru8 气凝胶上定制关键中间体和界面水，用于从硝酸盐可持续合成氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166994","t":"Atomized potassium-assisted hydrogen generation from ammonia decomposition over ruthenium loaded carbon-based catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166994","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qi Li","Hongfei Pan","Xiege Huang","Wei Xi","Wenmao Tu","Haining Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"原子化钾助剂在负载 Ru 的碳基催化剂上促进氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166686","t":"Fe(II)-rich catalytic interfaces boost nitrate adsorption and hydrogenation for selective electrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166686","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hanxue Wang","Shiyin Yuan","Yan Jia","Yinghao Xue","Dongqi Zhao","Jianwei Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"富 Fe(II) 的催化界面促进硝酸盐吸附和加氢，用于选择性电化学氨合成","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166680","t":"Self-reconstructed Cu2O/Co3O4@NC heterostructured catalyst for efficient tandem electrocatalytic conversion of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166680","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lin Zhu Dai","Guo Yu Yong","Wan Ni Gan","Ting Li","Zhi Cheng Chen","Lun Yao Pan"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"自重构Cu2O/Co3O4@NC异质结构催化剂用于高效串联电催化将硝酸盐转化为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166374","t":"Enhancing nitrate reduction reaction electroactivity of Fe single atom catalyst by modification of Fe nanoclusters and further application in self-powered ammonia synthesis from air","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166374","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Bingyi Song","Dong Xiang","Chengjie Chen","Jinchang Xu","Yangshuai Ma","Linjing Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过Fe纳米簇改性增强Fe单原子催化剂的硝酸盐还原反应电活性及其在自供电氨合成中的应用","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cclet.2025.111294","t":"A zinc-nitrate battery for efficient ammonia electrosynthesis and energy output by a high entropy hydroxide catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cclet.2025.111294","s":"Chinese Chemical Letters","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mingxing Chen","Xue Li","Nian Liu","Zihe Du","Zhitao Wang","Jing Qi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"锌硝酸盐电池用于高效氨电合成和高熵氢氧化物催化剂的能量输出","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115378","t":"Efficient hydrogen production from ammonia over Ru-Co/SiC catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115378","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This study provides a valuable insight into the influence of the order impregnation of ruthenium and cobalt on β-SiC support as catalysts for efficient green hydrogen production from ammonia. The catalysts were characterized using different techniques such as Temperature Programmed Reduction, X-Ray Diffraction, Transmission Electron Microscopy and Scanning Electron Microscopy. The addition of Ru clearly changed the reduction profile, decreasing the temperature to obtain metallic species. The catalyst prepared by co-impregnation inhibited the formation of Co silicates, which are very difficult to reduce. Additionally, the metal size was also affected by the order of impregnation, with the co-impregnation method showing the smallest crystallite sizes and the highest hydrogen production. On the other hand, it was found that the 2.5 wt.% total metal content catalyst improved the hydrogen pro","au":["M. Pinzón","C. Martín","A. Romero","A.R. de la Osa","P. Sánchez"],"o":"回填","why":["hydrogen production from ammonia"],"zt":"高效氨分解制氢的Ru-Co/SiC催化剂","zb":"该研究提供了关于 ruthenium 和 cobalt 在 β-SiC 载体上顺序浸渍作为高效绿色氢气生产催化剂影响的宝贵见解。催化剂使用不同的技术进行了表征，如程序升温还原、X射线衍射、透射电子显微镜和扫描电子显微镜。Ru的添加明显改变了还原曲线，降低了获得金属物种的温度。共浸渍制备的催化剂抑制了Co硅酸盐的形成，Co硅酸盐非常难以还原。此外，金属尺寸也受浸渍顺序的影响，共浸渍方法显示出最小的晶粒尺寸和最高的氢气产量。另一方面，研究发现，总金属含量为2.5 wt.%的催化剂在350 ºC时将氢气生产速率提高了41%，而总金属含量为5 wt.%的催化剂则相反，这证明了使用较低金属负载量的合理性。因此，使用50/50重量比的Ru/Co共浸渍和2.5 wt.%的金属负载量实现了最高活性，该催化剂在50小时的反应中表现出95%的转化率，并具有优异的活性和稳定性。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125435","t":"Hydrogen spillover mediated nitrite hydrogenation for ultralow-potential ammonia electrosynthesis over platinum nanoparticles anchored on Cu hydroxide nanowires","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125435","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xinzhi Wang","Lunhong Ai","Qiyao Zeng","Jiayi Zhang","Chenghui Zhang","Aike Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"氢溢流介导的亚硝酸氢化用于铂纳米颗粒锚定在氢氧化铜纳米线上的超低电位氨电合成","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125417","t":"Feδ+-O-Bi atomic pair site with asymmetric charge redistribution tuning non-covalent interaction for ammonia photosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125417","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mei Zhang","Yao Wu","Chao Chen","Jun Xiong","Zhiwei Shao","Yingjie Hua"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia photosynthesis"],"zt":"Feδ+-O-Bi 原子对位点通过非对称电荷重新分布调节非共价相互作用用于氨光合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/slct.202504759","t":"Cu‐Doped Activated Co 3 O 4 : Tandem Site Efficient Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/slct.202504759","s":"ChemistrySelect","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electroreduction of nitrate (NO 3 − ) into ammonia (NH 3 ) presents a promising avenue for sustainable ammonia synthesis. In this study, we construct electrocatalyst with tandem sites that integrates highly dispersed Cu with Co 3 O 4 by self‐sacrifice strategy using MOF as a template, which significantly improves NH 3 production. The resulting Cu–Co 3 O 4 catalyst achieves an NH 3 yield rate of 7.25 mg h −1 cm −2 and Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 95%. Mechanism research shows that Cu enhances NO 3 − adsorption, the synergy between Cu and Co 3 O 4 increases the electrochemical active area, reduces charge transfer resistance, and inhibits hydrogen evolution reaction. The confinement effect of Co 3 O 4 effectively ensures the stability of Cu 2+ in the electrocatalytic reduction reaction process. This work offers valuable insights into the tandem NO 3 − reduction pathway in hetero","au":["Shanshan Niu","Lei‐lei Qian","Yin‐yuan Wang","Guoxiang Chu","Yingluo Wu","Ji Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu-掺杂活化 Co3O4：串联位点高效电催化还原硝酸为氨","zb":"硝酸（NO3−）电还原为氨（NH3）为可持续氨合成提供了有前景的途径。本研究通过自牺牲策略使用 MOF 作为模板，构建了集成高度分散 Cu 与 Co3O4 的电催化剂，显著提高了 NH3 产量。所得 Cu–Co3O4 催化剂实现 NH3 产率为 7.25 mg h −1 cm −2 和法拉第效率（FE）为 95%。机理研究表明 Cu 增强了 NO3 − 吸附，Cu 与 Co3O4 之间的协同作用增加了电化学活性面积，降低了电荷转移电阻，并抑制了析氢反应。Co3O4 的限域效应有效确保了 Cu2+ 在电催化还原反应过程中的稳定性。该工作为异质结构中的串联 NO3 − 还原途径提供了有价值的见解，为优化催化剂和推进可持续 NH3 合成奠定了基础。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117745","t":"Fundamental study on the dose-effect relationship of urease inhibitors for ammonia reduction and methane recovery in simulated swine urine","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117745","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yun-Ju Jeon","Tae-Hoon Kim","Eun-Sol Kim","Seoktae Kang","Hyojeon Kim","Siyoung Seo"],"o":"回填","zt":"关于尿酶抑制剂对模拟猪尿液中氨还原和甲烷回收的剂量效应关系的基础研究","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117541","t":"Synthesis of high entropy, bidimensional mixed oxides from multimetallic layered double hydroxide precursors and application in photocatalytic N2 hydrogenation to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117541","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A multimetallic layered double hydroxide containing seven metals has been prepared by coprecipitation in DMF/H 2 O at pH 10 and converted into a seven metal mixed oxide. This high-entropy mixed metal (HE-MO) inherits from the LDH precursor the hexagonal sheet morphology. High resolution transmission electron microscopy, and EDS elemental mapping convincingly proves the absence of segregation of some elements in a different phase. Remarkably, neither noble metals nor lanthanides are used during the synthesis, and no reduction processes are needed to obtain the HE-MO. The resulting HE-MO promotes under continuous flow the photocatalytic nitrogen hydrogenation at atmospheric pressure and 200 o C with UV-vis light (108 mW cm -2 ) at a rate of 20 µmol NH 3 ·g -1 ·h -1 , lower or higher temperatures resulting in lower rates. This NH 3 rate formation is much higher than that of a CoFe mixed oxi","au":["Manuel Molina-Muriel","Adrián Pastor","Fernando Déniz","Antonio Ribera","Hermenegildo García"],"o":"回填","zt":"从多金属层状双氢氧化物前驱体合成高熵二维混合氧化物及其在光催化N2氢化制氨中的应用","zb":"通过在DMF/H 2 O中pH 10的共沉淀制备了含有七种金属的多金属层状双氢氧化物，并将其转化为七金属混合氧化物。这种高熵混合金属（HE-MO）继承了LDH前驱体的六方片状形态。高分辨率透射电子显微镜和EDS元素映射有力地证明了某些元素在不同相中的分离不存在。值得注意的是，在合成过程中既未使用贵金属也未使用镧系元素，并且无需还原过程即可获得HE-MO。所得HE-MO在连续流动条件下促进了大气压和200 o C下用UV-vis光（108 mW cm -2 ）的光催化氮氢化，速率为20 µmol NH 3 ·g -1 ·h -1 ，较低或较高的温度导致速率降低。这种NH 3 速率形成远高于CoFe混合氧化物参考或文献中报道的无贵金属光催化剂的值。使用同位素标记的15 N 2 坚实地证明了这种气体是形成NH 3 的来源。N 2 和H 2 比例的影响表明，决速步骤是光催化剂表面活性H物种的产生，","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116287","t":"Mechanistic insights into nitrate electroreduction on CuNi alloys: d-band center modulation of key intermediates","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116287","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Qiuling Jiang","Ying Wang","Zhijian Wu"],"o":"回填","zt":"硝酸在CuNi合金上的电还原机理：d带中心调制关键中间体","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166825","t":"Metal-organic frameworks-derived Fe3O4@NC catalyst for selective electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to dinitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166825","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Ruofan Li","Jianwei Fan","Wei-xian Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"金属有机框架衍生的 Fe3O4@NC 催化剂用于选择性电催化还原硝酸盐为氮气","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.166764","t":"Enhancing the thermal conductivity of carbon fiber composites by unzipping MWCNTs into GNRs through flash Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.166764","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Lin Li","Zefeng Yang","Yun Liao","Lei Deng","Shangang Zhou","Keqiao Zeng"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪蒸焦耳热将 MWCNTs 解构为 GNRs 以增强碳纤维复合材料的导热性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.bioelechem.2025.109007","t":"Ammonia recovery from waste streams: Energy efficiency and performance of microbial electrochemical system and electrochemical system","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bioelechem.2025.109007","s":"Bioelectrochemistry","d":"2025-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Nutrient recovery from waste streams, particularly digestate from anaerobic digestion, represents a promising strategy for sustainable waste management and circular economy practices. This study evaluated the performance of electrochemical (ES) and Microbial electrochemical systems (MES) for ammonia recovery from digestate under varying voltages. Energy consumption, and natural pH increase in catholyte were investigated for increased recovery efficiency. The results demonstrate that MES and ES exhibited similar recovery rates, with ammonia recovery reaching approx. 49 % at 1.2 V, while at lower energy efficiency MES outperformed ES. At '0' voltage, MES achieved a baseline recovery of 31.85 %, significantly higher than ES (13.25 %), highlighting the contribution of microbial electrochemical activity in driving nutrient recovery with minimal energy input. MES exhibited remarkably lower ene","au":["Dileep Kumar Yeruva","Irini Angelidaki"],"o":"回填","zt":"从废物流中回收氨：微生物电化学系统和电化学系统的能效和性能","zb":"该研究评估了电化学系统和微生物电化学系统在厌氧消化消化物中回收氨的性能，研究了不同电压下的回收率、能耗和阴极pH自然增加对提高回收效率的影响。结果表明，MES和ES表现出相似的回收率，在1.2 V时氨回收率约为49%，而能量效率较低MES优于ES。在'0'电压下，MES实现了31.85%的基线回收率，显著高于ES（13.25%），突出了微生物电化学活动在以最小能量输入驱动营养回收方面的贡献。MES表现出显著较低的能量消耗，在低施加电压下需要ES九倍的能量，这是由于微生物活动和生物电生成的协同效应。此外，MES最大限度地减少了铵转运损失，并在阴极pH变化中表现出更好的稳定性，有利于长期运行可行性。MES作为更可持续的氨回收替代方案，强调了其在全球碳中和和营养循环过程中的潜在价值。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"}]);
